nd those protesters have already become part of the fortress structure along with another §R[Root.dirt_kia]§! people. §R[Root.dirt_city_kia]§! cities were buried by foot filth, and the hard crust and remaining foot sweat crystals will bring great convenience to our country's military development!"
 
