   gts_ap_planet.3002.desc: "§Y[Root.GetName]§! is a beautiful planet with deep blue oceans and emerald forests, so much so that the Doctor feels a pang of reluctance... and a hint of guilt at the thought of using her own dick to transform it into a planet covered in cloudy white semen. Stirred by this guilt, the Doctor's giant root, nearly ten thousand kilometers long, could no longer be held back and burst out of her panties, casting a sky-obscuring shadow over the planet about to be humiliated. The inhabitants of the planet looked desperately at the sky, while wild animals became restless, searching futilely for places to hide.\n\nThe Doctor carefully stroked her giant penis with her hand, feeling the semen and blood ready to burst forth within the meat rod, imagining the scene on the ground and feeling both sorrow and excitement for the tiny people. Finally, semen sprayed from the urethra, billions of tons of semen smashing into the ocean, raising waves higher than the atmosphere. Countless islands were buried forever under the sticky white turbidity without even time to react. Like continents, blocks of semen, carrying tens of billions of sperm, rolled down. Coastal cities were submerged by giant waves full of fishy-smelling foam. Ignorant and ferocious sperm raged, crushing cities and tiny people, turning the white sticky semen pink.\n\nHowever, the Doctor was not finished yet. Her giant root remained erect, so she pressed the penis, dripping with celestial-grade semen, directly against the hemisphere not yet affected by the semen. The slippery meat rod recklessly flattened forests and cities, leaving a isthmus flowing with fishy semen connecting the boiling oceans. The Doctor gently hugged the semen-covered planet with both hands, rubbing her hot, throbbing meat rod back and forth. The scarce continents were completely shattered, and the continuously ejaculating semen turned into new high mountains. Sticky and warm semen finally covered the entire planet. White turbid mucus replaced oceans and continents, and even the near-earth orbit was covered with scattered rings of semen. Having completed her mission, the Doctor gently stroked the milky white surface of the planet with her hand, skimming off some excess semen to let a few remaining pieces of land emerge from the warm sea of semen. With her soft tongue, she tasted the flavor of her own seed, gently swallowing millions of survivors along with it. Semen dripping from the tip of her tongue stuck to her uniform, making the Doctor look incredibly charming.\n\nThe surface of §Y[Root.GetName]§! can no longer bear anymore semen, but the Doctor seems not satisfied yet... As for the residents on this planet, they will soon be excited about their home becoming vibrant."
