   gts_ap_planet.3004.desc: "§Y[Root.GetName]§! has a surface that is dry and boring, covered almost entirely by deserts and dry grasslands, so much so that even the Doctor's meat rod couldn't get erect due to boredom. However, considering there are billions of tiny people on the surface \"expecting\" her arrival, the Doctor pulled herself together, took off her panties, revealing the sky-obscuring giant meat rod.\n\nThe Doctor ruthlessly jerked her meat rod up and down vigorously while imagining the helpless look of the little guys on the ground. Finally, semen sprayed from the urethra. Billions of tons of semen rampaged across the desert. A tsunami of white turbidity, dozens of times higher than mountains, swept everything on the ground. Hundreds of cities and their inhabitants had their traces on this planet erased by semen without even time to react.\n\nHowever, the Doctor did not feel satisfied at all. She poked this pitiful planet with her meat rod, graffitiing her own portrait on it with semen. But semen mixed with city ruins and the remains of millions of tiny people obviously couldn't draw anything decent. The Doctor soon got bored. To vent her sexual desire quickly, she grabbed the semen-covered planet directly with both hands and rubbed her unsatisfied meat rod back and forth savagely. The crust of the entire planet was nearly shattered. The giant penis tore everything apart, kicking up sandstorms that blocked out the sun. Countless tiny people could only pray for this to end quickly, while the moans from above signaled that the end was near. When the Doctor's glans pressed against §Y[Root.GetName]§! and ejaculated, the entire planet could feel the violent tremor of the meat rod. Cities and even continents were wrapped in semen and sprayed into space, becoming biospheres that could never return home, while more semen fell with gravity, landing on the ground and the Doctor's uniform, making her look incredibly charming. Seeing this planet finally covered by semen, she gently rubbed her face against the sticky earth, tasting her work with her tongue, feeling the new life she brought to §Y[Root.GetName]§!.\n\nThe surface of §Y[Root.GetName]§! can no longer bear anymore semen, but the Doctor seems not satisfied yet... As for the residents on this planet, they will soon be excited about their home becoming vibrant."
