-  # Original: 我们为$gts_wind_creatures$提供了大量的$gts_giantess_fluid$与合金碎屑。这些磨料很轻，可以被单独的气流冲走，但又足够强大，可以在短时间内切削下大块的足垢。\n\n一股气流迅速利用这些合金碎屑撕碎了躲在附近裂缝里的一簇黄色$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$。\n\n$gts_wind_creatures$继续将合金切料更广泛地分布在它们之间。猛烈的风开始袭击足垢裂谷，在一场协调一致的斩首轰炸中瞄准了喷出孢子的$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$。\n\n也许是为了表示感谢，一阵微风给我们送来了一捆毛茸茸的“浮卵”。有了这些，我们就可以培育自己的“$gts_wind_creatures$”，把这种高度适应巨娘足下环境与$gts_giantess_fluid$运用的气流带到我们选定的一些殖民地。
+  # Original: 我们为$gts_wind_creatures$提供了大量的$gts_giantess_fluid$与合金碎屑。这些磨料很轻，可以被单独的气流冲走，但又足够强大，可以在短时间内切削下大块的足垢。\n\n一股气流迅速利用这些合金碎屑撕碎了躲在附近裂缝里的一簇黄色$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$。\n\n$gts_wind_creatures$继续将合金切料更广泛地分布在它们之间。猛烈的风开始袭击足垢裂谷，在一场协调一致的斩首轰炸中瞄准了喷出孢子的$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$。\n\n也许是为了表示感谢，一阵微风给我们送来了一捆毛茸茸的\"浮卵\"。有了这些，我们就可以培育自己的\"$gts_wind_creatures$\"，把这种高度适应巨娘足下环境与$gts_giantess_fluid$运用的气流带到我们选定的一些殖民地。
   gts_astral_rift.2755.desc: "We provided large amounts of $gts_giantess_fluid$ and alloy scrap to the $gts_wind_creatures$. These abrasives are light enough to be carried by individual air currents, but strong enough to cut off large chunks of foot grime in a short time.\n\nA stream of air quickly used these alloy scraps to shred a cluster of yellow $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ hiding in a nearby crevice.\n\nThe $gts_wind_creatures$ continued to distribute the alloy cuttings more widely among themselves. The violent wind began to attack the foot grime rifts, targeting the spore-spewing $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ in a coordinated decapitation bombardment.\n\nPerhaps as a token of gratitude, a breeze sent us a bundle of furry \"floating eggs\". With these, we can cultivate our own \"$gts_wind_creatures$\" and bring this airflow, highly adapted to the environment under a Giantess's foot and the use of $gts_giantess_fluid$, to some of our selected colonies."
   # Original: 真菌绽放
   gts_astral_rift.2760.name: "Fungal Bloom"
-  # Original: 我们在星球表面散布了大量的$gts_giantess_fluid$作为营养物质，并在较为丰富的足垢山脉中引入了新的抗风植物。然后，$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$能够在植物风化的足垢土壤上传播大量的孢子。\n\n现有的$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$群在规模和复原力上已经在增长。随着时间的推移，$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$会沿着鞋垫的整个表面蔓延，使$gts_wind_creatures$的繁殖失去根基——毫无疑问，风的真正来源，巨娘轻微的足部活动对于这些狂风的繁殖过程而言也过于剧烈。\n\n$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$的节点充满了新发现的力量，感激的信息正沿着它的菌丝网络传递。\n\n一种以前未被发现的$trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$标本随后从我们附近的足垢中发芽。它的球茎腔充满了高浓度的外来气体。我们相信，培育这些“泡沫球”将有助于我们生产这种宝贵的资源。
-  gts_astral_rift.2760.desc: "We spread a large amount of $gts_giantess_fluid$ on the planet's surface as nutrients and introduced new wind-resistant plants in the richer foot grime mountains. Then, $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ was able to spread valid spores on the foot grime soil weathered by plants.\n\nThe existing $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ colonies are growing in scale and resilience. Over time, $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ will spread along the entire surface of the insole, removing the foundation for the reproduction of $gts_wind_creatures$—undoubtedly, the true source of the wind, the Giantess's slight foot movements, are too violent for the reproductive process of these fierce winds.\n\nThe nodes of $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ are filled with newfound power, and messages of gratitude are being transmitted along its mycelial network.\n\nA previously undiscovered specimen of $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ subsequently sprouted from the foot grime near us. Its bulbous cavity is filled with high concentrations of exotic gas. We believe that cultivating these \"spore balls\" will help us produce this valuable resource."
