+  gts_astral_rift.2760.desc: "We spread a large amount of $gts_giantess_fluid$ on the planet's surface as nutrients and introduced new wind-resistant plants in the richer foot grime mountains. Then, $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ was able to spread valid spores on the foot grime soil weathered by plants.\n\nThe existing $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ colonies are growing in scale and resilience. Over time, $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ will spread along the entire surface of the insole, removing the foundation for the reproduction of $gts_wind_creatures$ - undoubtedly, the true source of the wind, the Giantess's slight foot movements, are too violent for the reproductive process of these fierce winds.\n\nThe nodes of $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ are filled with newfound power, and messages of gratitude are being transmitted along its mycelial network.\n\nA previously undiscovered specimen of $trait_gts_under_feet_fungus$ subsequently sprouted from the foot grime near us. Its bulbous cavity is filled with high concentrations of exotic gas. We believe that cultivating these \"spore balls\" will help us produce this valuable resource."
