-  # Original: 突然，几百米外出现了一个内含星舰大小人工结构的无定形团块。我们试图从远处观察它——却引起了它的注意。\n\n实体通过膜与§Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!接触融合。它内部的人工结构则释放出大量微型单元；我们说话这会儿，那些微型单元已经抵近§Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!，球体正在被攻击。
-  gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common: "Suddenly, an amorphous mass containing an artificial structure the size of a starship appeared a few hundred meters away. We tried to observe it from a distance—but attracted its attention.\n\nThe entity contacted and merged with the §Y$tech_rift_sphere$§! through membranes. The artificial structure inside it released a large number of micro-units; as we speak, those micro-units have approached the §Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!, and the sphere is under attack."
+  # Original: 突然，几百米外出现了一个内含星舰大小人工结构的无定形团块。我们试图从远处观察它 -  - 却引起了它的注意。\n\n实体通过膜与§Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!接触融合。它内部的人工结构则释放出大量微型单元；我们说话这会儿，那些微型单元已经抵近§Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!，球体正在被攻击。
+  gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common: "Suddenly, an amorphous mass containing an artificial structure the size of a starship appeared a few hundred meters away. We tried to observe it from a distance - but attracted its attention.\n\nThe entity contacted and merged with the §Y$tech_rift_sphere$§! through membranes. The artificial structure inside it released a large number of micro-units; as we speak, those micro-units have approached the §Y$tech_rift_sphere$§!, and the sphere is under attack."
   # Original: 我们的战术指挥官建议立即撤离，但我们的生物学家认为可以通过结合我们手头的气体和液体来消灭这些单元。
   gts_astral_rift.1315.desc_no_gestalt: "Our tactical commander suggests immediate evacuation, but our biologist believes we can eliminate these units by combining the gases and liquids we have on hand."
   # Original: 也许需要紧急撤离，但我们也推测可以通过适当的气体和液体组合来消灭这些单元。
   gts_astral_rift.1315.desc_gestalt: "Immediate evacuation might be necessary, but we also speculate that these units can be eliminated with the right combination of gases and liquids."
-  # Original: 在洞口的另一边，我们进入了另一个腔体。这个腔室的规模使我们迄今为止见过的任何腔室都相形见绌——无论是宏伟的主宰装配厂，还是呼啸的气态巨行星实验室。\n\n在这里，相较于少女无边的娇躯。纤细而精致的分枝卷须向各个方向伸展。它们都是如此错综复杂地交织在一起。\n\n§E这无疑是§E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!的肺部！§!\n\n我们很难再前进一步。不过肺部环境中频繁的物质交换使得此处的流体充满了气体和“其它物质”，这对我们来说很有收集价值。\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$
-  gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.default: "On the other side of the opening, we entered another cavity. The scale of this chamber dwarfs any we have seen so far—whether it be the magnificent Juggernaut assembly yard or the howling gas giant laboratory.\n\nHere, compared to the boundless body of the girl. Slender and exquisite branching tendrils stretch in all directions. They are so intricately interwoven.\n\n§EThis is undoubtedly the lungs of §E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!!§!\n\nWe can hardly take another step. However, the frequent material exchange in the lung environment fills the fluid here with gases and \"other substances\", which are valuable for us to collect.\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$"
