-  # Original: 一边与§E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!的脉搏抗争，一边追踪结晶的流动轨迹。我们终于从离开上一个腔室的漫长漂流中落定——我们进入了一个由颤抖的水晶组成的复杂洞穴系统，周围的墙壁似乎滤过了来自各个方向的液体，那些颤抖的水晶则是液体中留下的结晶残留物。\n\n我们同样是被水流带到此处。希望我们不会被滞留在周围的墙壁上。\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$
-  gts_astral_rift.1316.desc.default: "Fighting against the pulse of §E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§! while tracking the flow of crystals. We finally settled from the long drift leaving the previous chamber—we entered a complex cave system composed of trembling crystals. The surrounding walls seemed to filter the liquid from all directions, and those trembling crystals were the crystalline residues left in the liquid.\n\nWe were also brought here by the current. Hopefully, we won't get stuck on the surrounding walls.\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$"
+  # Original: 一边与§E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!的脉搏抗争，一边追踪结晶的流动轨迹。我们终于从离开上一个腔室的漫长漂流中落定 -  - 我们进入了一个由颤抖的水晶组成的复杂洞穴系统，周围的墙壁似乎滤过了来自各个方向的液体，那些颤抖的水晶则是液体中留下的结晶残留物。\n\n我们同样是被水流带到此处。希望我们不会被滞留在周围的墙壁上。\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$
+  gts_astral_rift.1316.desc.default: "Fighting against the pulse of §E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§! while tracking the flow of crystals. We finally settled from the long drift leaving the previous chamber - we entered a complex cave system composed of trembling crystals. The surrounding walls seemed to filter the liquid from all directions, and those trembling crystals were the crystalline residues left in the liquid.\n\nWe were also brought here by the current. Hopefully, we won't get stuck on the surrounding walls.\n\n$gts_astral_rift.1315.desc.common$"
