-  # Original: 尽管其尺寸巨大，但这个结构的防护体系却极度原始。\n\n在释放出我们独特的混合气体后不久，它的内部就崩溃了。它释放的微型单元变成了无头苍蝇，巨大的核心也不再有任何反应。\n\n我们很高兴地报告对这个物体的成功回收，它的真正核心与我们维度中许多单细胞生物的细胞核并没有完全不同，除了附着其上——共生的神秘人工结构。
+  # Original: 尽管其尺寸巨大，但这个结构的防护体系却极度原始。\n\n在释放出我们独特的混合气体后不久，它的内部就崩溃了。它释放的微型单元变成了无头苍蝇，巨大的核心也不再有任何反应。\n\n我们很高兴地报告对这个物体的成功回收，它的真正核心与我们维度中许多单细胞生物的细胞核并没有完全不同，除了附着其上 -  - 共生的神秘人工结构。
   gts_astral_rift.1325.desc.common.1: "Despite its massive size, the defense system of this structure was extremely primitive.\n\nShortly after releasing our unique gas mixture, its interior collapsed. The micro-units it released became headless flies, and the giant core ceased to react.\n\nWe are pleased to report the successful recovery of this object. Its true core is not entirely different from the nuclei of many single-celled organisms in our dimension, except for the symbiotic mysterious artificial structure attached to it."
-  # Original: 我们猜测这个结构是§E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!体内的某个微型文明与少女免疫细胞融合而形成的。这个文明已经与免疫细胞的生活方式彻底结合，也就是说——文明的一切都依赖于少女免疫细胞的生活方式。\n\n因此，遵照免疫细胞的行为逻辑，他们也将我们视为外来威胁。也许这也是他们获取那些“非生物质”物资的方式？\n\n总而言之。我们带着战利品伤痕累累地回来了。
-  gts_astral_rift.1325.desc.common.2: "We speculate that this structure was formed by the fusion of a micro-civilization within §E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§! and a Giantess immune cell. This civilization has been thoroughly integrated with the lifestyle of the immune cell, meaning—everything about the civilization depends on the immune cell's way of life.\n\nTherefore, following the behavioral logic of an immune cell, they also viewed us as a foreign threat. Perhaps this is also how they acquire those \"non-biological\" resources?\n\nAll in all. We returned with our spoils, bruised and battered."
+  # Original: 我们猜测这个结构是§E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§!体内的某个微型文明与 maiden免疫细胞融合而形成的。这个文明已经与免疫细胞的生活方式彻底结合，也就是说 -  - 文明的一切都依赖于 maiden免疫细胞的生活方式。\n\n因此，遵照免疫细胞的行为逻辑，他们也将我们视为外来威胁。也许这也是他们获取那些\"非生物质\"物资的方式？\n\n总而言之。我们带着战利品伤痕累累地回来了。
+  gts_astral_rift.1325.desc.common.2: "We speculate that this structure was formed by the fusion of a micro-civilization within §E[event_target:gts_astral_rift_fluid.GetName]§! and a Giantess immune cell. This civilization has been thoroughly integrated with the lifestyle of the immune cell, meaning - everything about the civilization depends on the immune cell's way of life.\n\nTherefore, following the behavioral logic of an immune cell, they also viewed us as a foreign threat. Perhaps this is also how they acquire those \"non-biological\" resources?\n\nAll in all. We returned with our spoils, bruised and battered."
