like foot wrapped in white silk stockings swaying involuntarily. \nNow, the entire galaxy was shrouded in white silk stockings. Although the scent they emitted caused some discomfort to the local residents, who wouldn't want to get a close-up look at a beautiful young woman's white silk stockings?"
