ng the fleet in low orbit into the cotton sock soaked in foot sweat. Residents on the ground only found the sky falling into infinite darkness. Space forces desperately lit up fluorescent lights, barely lighting up a corner of the sky dome, allowing people to understand what happened: thick knitted fibers twisted together, escaping white mist constantly falling into the target planet under gravity. In an instant, the planet's atmosphere was branded with her mark: white mist gathered into cumulus clouds on the planet, then turned into spring rain, watering [event_target:gts_leader_planet.GetName]; tiny residents had nowhere to hide, forced to breathe the repulsive smell.\n\nIn the last piece of night sky, only two slender fingers were seen gently tapping the sock opening. [event_target:current_gts_leader.GetName]'s voice drifted in from the gap: §H\"Then please reflect well in my scent.\"§! She quickly tied the sock opening, [event_target:gts_leader_planet.GetName] fell into endless dark night. Just wonder if they felt a trace of regret under the washing of foot sweat?"
