   # Original: 6.艾雅法拉\n简介：一位沉睡多年的火山学者，尽管重病缠身，但她仍愿意为科学发展贡献自己的力量\n体型：泰坦/天体\n属性：软糯后辈、温柔系/无意识系、多重大小、体表探索\n特殊机制：丰富的剧情事件\n\n该角色包含的事件：\n*招募考古事件链(开启需要在该星球上清除火山之母障碍)\n*治愈源石病事件链(定时触发)\n*涨奶事件(定期重复触发)\n*天体级成长事件(治愈后定时触发)\n*足底测绘事件(治愈后定时触发)\n*与小花田的联动事件(同时拥有两位领袖，每五年检测一次)
   gts_setting.101.6a: "6. Eyjafjalla\nIntroduction: A volcanologist who has been asleep for many years. Despite being riddled with serious illness, she is still willing to contribute her strength to scientific development\nBody Size: Titan/Celestial\nAttributes: Soft Junior, Gentle Type/Unconscious Type, Multiple Sizes, Body Surface Exploration\nSpecial Mechanism: Rich plot events\n\nEvents included:\n*Recruitment Archaeology Event Chain (Requires clearing Mother of Volcanoes obstacle on the planet to open)\n*Cure Oripathy Event Chain (Timed Trigger)\n*Milk Engorgement Event (Triggered repeatedly regularly)\n*Celestial Level Growth Event (Timed Trigger after cure)\n*Sole Mapping Event (Timed Trigger after cure)\n*Linkage Event with Little Huatian (Own both leaders at the same time, checked every five years)"
