   gts_setting.102.7a: "19. Huatian\nIntroduction: This leader comes from the final plan of an ancient civilization. Due to past experiences, she has a natural affection for the small person races in the star sea. After obtaining approval, the small person individuals who immigrated to her body also provided us with considerable jobs and resources\nBody Size: Celestial\nAttributes: Energetic Girl, Gentle Type/Unconscious Type\nSpecial Mechanism: Rich plot events and affinity mechanism, can recruit special Shipgirls\n\nEvents included:\n*Recruitment Archaeology Event Chain (Two lines have plot differences)\n*Post-Recruitment Daily Events (Triggered randomly)\n*Little Huatian Affinity Event (Triggered three years after recruitment)\n*Little Huatian Shipgirl Modification (Affinity greater than 50 and talk to Huatian)\n*Colossus Event (Use Colossus weapon equipped by Shipgirl Huatian)\n*Leader Origin Archaeology (Affinity greater than 75)\n*Leader Body Size Modification Event (Use Huatian Relic)\n*Endfield Event (Let Huatian enter Endfield Black Hole)\n*Endfield Daily Event (Triggered one year after entering Endfield)\n*Linkage Event with Thousand Seas (Own both leaders at the same time, Galaxy Action choose Celestial Feast)"
   # Original: 20.晓淼\n简介：失散多年的妹妹，如今对我来说就如同微生物一样\n体型：微小\n属性：缩小女\n特殊机制：mod唯一的小人领袖，设定上是玩家的妹妹\n\n该角色包含的事件：\n*招募考古事件链(选择拒绝可以把晓淼变成玩具)\n*招募后巨大化尝试事件(定时触发)
