   gts_setting.102.12a: "24. Thousand Seas\nIntroduction: A purple-haired succubus girl, hoping to spend a relaxed and happy time here\nBody Size: Celestial\nAttributes: Succubus Girl, Unconscious, Inside Hole, Yuri\nSpecial Mechanism: Rich plot events and special mechanisms\n\nEvents included:\n*Recruitment Event Chain\n*Post-Recruitment Events (Timed Trigger/Random Trigger)\n*Interaction with Titan Giantess (Cannot be Titan Leader in Communication Panel)\n*Special Modify Love Fluid Planet Event\n*Wear Shoes Event (Explore \"Shoe Cabinet\" system trigger Celestial Uniform Shoe Event choose let Thousand Seas come)\n*Linkage Event with Huatian (Own both leaders at the same time, Galaxy Action choose Celestial Feast)\n*Linkage Event with Yharon (Chat with Thousand Seas after Yharon comes of age)\n*Universal Sea Extreme Universe Origin Linkage Event (Small probability to trigger after completing Insurance Project Foot Sweat Stockings)"
