   gts_setting.103.2a: "26. Yharon\nIntroduction: The girl who hatched from the ruins of the old Ecumenopolis. She is the god of the past and the princess of the empire today. She has a magnificent body comparable to a star, but also shows the immature side unique to a girl - respond to her expectations\nBody Size: Celestial\nAttributes: Dragon Girl, Daughter, Tsundere, Dog-like\nSpecial Mechanism: Rich plot events and special mechanisms\n\nEvents included:\n*Main Line includes in trigger order:\n-Incubation Event Chain\n-Forging Armor into Skirt (Upgrade Ecumenopolis Ruins to God Statue)\n-Yharon Leader Recruitment/Coming of Age Ceremony (Triggered 5-10 years later)\n-Frolic, Dressing (Timed Trigger)\n-Forced Palace (Exist Zichen and Yharon at the same time, judged every five years)\n-External Colonization (Triggered 1800 days after Forced Palace)\n-Vassal Event (After Coronation, own non-Giantess Origin Vassal State, Titan Empire has difference)\n*Branch Line includes:\n-Change Teeth (Triggered 720 days after Incubation)\n-Internal Colonization Event Chain (Complete Dragon Transformation Civic)\n-Threat Arrogance and Anger (Triggered when Space Battle Victory during Total War)\n-Humiliation War (Triggered when Space Battle Victory, Spiritualist Country and own Love Fluid Planet Modification Tech has difference)\n-Vassal War (Triggered when Orbital Bombardment Enemy Capital)\n-Deduction Event (Year less than 2260 and War Victory)\n-Jealousy Event (Between Coming of Age Ceremony and Forced Palace, Colony judged every three years randomly triggered)\n*Yharon Affinity Event"
-  # Original: 3.1.2更新\n§Y新内容:§!\n#通用事件调整：\n——修复了寰海巨宇开局人口减少的问题\n——寰海巨宇保险项目现在会添加星球地貌\n——削弱了天体级巨娘的陆军加成\n——残骸回收事件激进的选项失败时会根据摧毁的舰船数量给予资源\n——新增了三大特殊巨娘国策（小人清除者、小人保护者、小人同化者）的统治者背景\n——修改了跳蛋星球的背景图片\n——新增了跳蛋星球修复完成的后续事件\n——修复了巨娘崇拜国策第一次接触无法触发温柔系特使的问题\n——新增了巨娘崇拜国策完成第一次接触的奖励\n§Y领袖相关调整：§!\n——新增了一个星际行动：安乐天使\n——新增了一位新领袖：希诺\n——仍在抵抗的星球随机事件各个领袖的特殊事件权重降低，且现在会增加领袖的击杀计数\n——各类型领袖登陆星球事件改成可多次触发，并修复了会将居住站转换为特殊星球的问题\n流萤：\n——新增了流萤舰船的模型\n——新增了一项流萤特殊的道具\n——修复了流萤雇佣无法续费的问题\n——修复了流萤舰船无法复活的问题\n犽戎：\n——修复了犽戎“特殊的军事演习”在领袖招募前触发的问题\n——新增了4张犽戎的加载图片\n——修复了招募泡泡舰队领袖没有安置的问题\n欧若拉\n——修改了欧若拉眼部模型（失去高光的萝莉.jpg）\n——欧若拉出生线挣脱后触碰到殖民地会直接将其吞噬\n艾雅法拉\n——艾雅法拉涨奶事件会将黑洞替换成白洞星球\n斯卡蒂\n——巨像武器虎鲸诱捕器现在可以为领袖斯卡蒂增加摧毁的星球、城市、人员数量，以及直接摧毁居住站\n——伊莎玛拉清算事件现在会生成不可殖民的爱液星球，但对特殊的巨娘星球无效\n——如果境内存在前光速文明，斯卡蒂的波涛福音事件会消灭它们\n萨拉托加\n——新增了萨拉托加的演习事件\n——萨拉托加的后续事件触发时间延长\n——萨拉托加的登陆事件不同的选项现在有不同的效果\n博士\n——新增了招募博士的后续事件
-  gts_update.3.1.2: "3.1.2 Update\n§YNew Content:§!\n#General Events Adjustment:\n——Fixed the issue of pop decrease at the start of Universal Sea Giant Universe\n——Universal Sea Giant Universe Insurance Project now adds planet landscape\n——Weakened Celestial Giantess Army bonus\n——Debris Recovery Event Aggressive Option failure now gives resources based on number of destroyed ships\n——Added Ruler Backgrounds for three special Giantess Civics (Small Person Purifier, Small Person Protector, Small Person Assimilator)\n——Modified Vibrator Planet background image\n——Added follow-up events for completion of Vibrator Planet repair\n——Fixed the issue that Giantess Worship Civic First Contact cannot trigger Gentle Type Envoy\n——Added First Contact rewards for Giantess Worship Civic\n§YLeader Related Adjustments:§!\n——Added an Interstellar Action: Angel of Euthanasia\n——Added a new leader: Xino\n——Reduced the weight of special events for each leader in random events of planets still resisting, and now adds to leader kill count\n——Landing Planet Events for each type of leader changed to be triggerable multiple times, and fixed the issue of converting habitats into special planets\nFirefly:\n——Added Firefly Ship Model\n——Added a special item for Firefly\n——Fixed the issue that Firefly Employment cannot be renewed\n——Fixed the issue that Firefly Ship cannot be resurrected\nYharon:\n——Fixed the issue that Yharon's \"Special Military Exercise\" triggers before leader recruitment\n——Added 4 loading images for Yharon\n——Fixed the issue of no placement for recruiting Paopao Fleet Leader\nAurora\n——Modified Aurora Eye Model (Loli loosing highlights.jpg)\n——Aurora Birth Line breaking free touching a colony will directly devour it\nEyjafjalla\n——Eyjafjalla Milk Engorgement Event will replace Black Hole with White Hole Planet\nSkadi\n——Colossus Weapon Orca Trap can now increase the number of destroyed planets, cities, and personnel for Leader Skadi, and directly destroy habitats\n——Ishar-mla Liquidation Event now generates uninhabitable Love Fluid Planet, but invalid for special Giantess Planets\n——If pre-FTL civilizations exist in the territory, Skadi's Gospel of Waves event will eliminate them\nSaratoga\n——Added Saratoga Exercise Event\n——Extended trigger time for Saratoga follow-up events\n——Different options for Saratoga Landing Event now have different effects\nDoctor\n——Added follow-up events for recruiting Doctor"
