-  gts_update.4.3.0: "# 4.3.0 Update\\n This new version makes significant changes to the underlying code, so you may encounter unexpected situations during gameplay. Feedback in the group is welcome.\\n\\n New Content:\\n ——Added a new leader: Xitong\\n ——Added shipgirl content for Lin Feng (no event images)\\n ——Added combined recruitment events for Xitong and Lin Feng (requires recruiting Xitong and completing shipgirl modification research)\\n ——Added Favorability traits and matching systems, integrating recruitment methods for leaders and ships\\n ——Added the start of the main questline and completed some parts of Qhai's communications\\n ——Added shortcut buttons to the leader interface for changing outfits and accessing communications\\n ——Added new outfits for Aplog, Aurora, Eyjafjalla, Goldenglow, and Mizuki\\n ——Added a setting to specify the minimum number of Giantess Empires at start\\n ——Added population acquisition events from branches for Huanhai Jiyu\\n ——New Panty Planet with animations\\n ——Added colony type descriptions\\n ——Azure Sea Group leaders can now change body pillow images, added a random event for Seele (requires a terrestrial planet)\\n\\n Adjustments:\\n ——Optimized Xilian's shoe model\\n ——Updated format and values for basic shipgirls\\n ——Modified Favorability events for Qhai and Hanada\\n ——All countries will have at least one GTS civic; countries with extreme ethics will receive fixed civics:\\n ——— Xenophile, Pacifist: Protector of the Little People\\n ——— Authoritarian, Spiritualist: Nation of Maids\\n ——— Xenophobe, Militarist: Exterminator of the Little People\\n ——— Egalitarian, Materialist: Assimilator of the Little People\\n\\n Bug Fixes:\\n ——Fixed a bug where Su Xiaobai's team events triggered abnormally\\n ——Fixed text errors in Gao-Da Empire and added missing evolution civic text\\n ——Corrected Gu-Ya's trait bonus errors\\n ——Fixed model errors\\n\\n Bruh Shipgirls:\\n ——Added task tracking for Bruh Shipgirl events\\n ——Added launch events for Bruh Shipgirl planet-killing weapons\\n ——Reworked various aspects of Bruh Shipgirls (almost everything) (1 task, 7 random events)\\n\\n Human Sovereign Origin:\\n ——Optimized allowance options, changed to country modifiers: +400 primary resources and +200 secondary resources monthly, switchable via the allowance interface\\n ——Optimized textures for Faralda\\n ——Added textures for origin-related buildings\\n ——Fixed issues with returning to the main menu in dialogues for Faralda and Illya\\n ——Optimized Heroic Spirit Summoning system, fixed bugs where specific summons wouldn't trigger Noble Phantasm upgrade events\\n ——Miyu's leader type changed to Scientist, Artoria's leader type changed to Administrator\\n ——Optimized and perfected some texts\\n ——Added new branch building: Pencil Case Foundry, providing Alloy output\\n ——Added three new technologies\\n ——Added new specialized district: Destructive Adaptive Urban Area, and three unique district buildings: Resistance Fortress, Little Person Studio, Large Landmark\\n ——Adjusted Human Sovereign Faith trait effect to: All Job Efficiency +20%\\n ——Added two new servants: Shiro von Einzbern, Galahad du Lac\\n ——Added character personal CG events\\n ——Added new planetary decisions"
