-  gts_prescripted_countries.1.desc: "On the vast, endless white plain, hundreds of massive colony ships stood ready to set sail, while dense crowds boarded the starships, about to embark on their journey to a new world. “Noble Goddess, in accordance with the agreement between our two nations, the treaty has taken effect. We thank you for your generosity and grace. For countless ages to come, our people will dwell, generation after generation, within your sacred and serene cave world, and will tirelessly cleanse and tend to your beautiful sanctuary.” “Please stop saying such embarrassing things...” A light, melodious child’s voice echoed from the heavens, The people aboard the colony ship gazed out the portholes toward the horizon. The world beyond the clouds and mist revealed a faint, delicate blush; one could vaguely make out jade-pillar-like contours and, higher up, a pale pink fissure that obscured most of the sky. In the empty room, a slightly childlike young girl stood naked before a pure-white table no higher than her thighs. A holographic projection of a contract flickered before her, and her jade-like toes shifted restlessly on the floor. Though she appeared slightly shy and self-conscious, the girl understood that this was the rite of passage every mature member of her clan must undergo. She slowly lowered her arms, which had been crossed over her chest, and her index fingers instinctively reached downward. “Tiny persons, you may come in now~”"
+  gts_prescripted_countries.1.desc: "On the vast, endless white plain, hundreds of massive colony ships stood ready to set sail, while dense crowds boarded the starships, about to embark on their journey to a new world. \"Noble Goddess, in accordance with the agreement between our two nations, the treaty has taken effect. We thank you for your generosity and grace. For countless ages to come, our people will dwell, generation after generation, within your sacred and serene cave world, and will tirelessly cleanse and tend to your beautiful sanctuary.\" \"Please stop saying such embarrassing things...\" A light, melodious child's voice echoed from the heavens, The people aboard the colony ship gazed out the portholes toward the horizon. The world beyond the clouds and mist revealed a faint, delicate blush; one could vaguely make out jade-pillar-like contours and, higher up, a pale pink fissure that obscured most of the sky. In the empty room, a slightly childlike young girl stood naked before a pure-white table no higher than her thighs. A holographic projection of a contract flickered before her, and her jade-like toes shifted restlessly on the floor. Though she appeared slightly shy and self-conscious, the girl understood that this was the rite of passage every mature member of her clan must undergo. She slowly lowered her arms, which had been crossed over her chest, and her index fingers instinctively reached downward. \"Tiny persons, you may come in now~\""
