-  gts_prescripted_countries.2.desc: "The melodious voice of the girl from beyond the heavens rang out, and a massive red warning light flashed to life at the bow of each colonial ship. Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, the fleet roared into action and set sail, heading straight for the increasingly pale pink fissure in the sky. At the same moment, two massive finger-like pillars descended from beyond the heavens, landing on either side of the fissure. As the pillars slowly exerted pressure, the fissure was steadily pried open, revealing an abyss resembling a cosmic void, surrounded by a red world that surged rhythmically like waves. A rich, youthful fragrance enveloped the entire fleet; everyone inhaled the scent—one they would come to know at every moment of their future lives—as if receiving a divine blessing. “This is my most precious spot, you know—no one’s ever parasitized it before~” A hint of pride tinged the girl’s tone as she watched strands of red-glowing dust drift from the white tabletop toward her soft, pink private parts; a blush spread across her cute, delicate face. Once all the red dust had disappeared into her opening, the girl gently released the two fingers holding her vulva apart, and the tender flesh—which had everted twice—instantly retracted inward. Hundreds of colonization ships were deployed in a grid-like formation within the flesh-colored ring-shaped cavity, which was as vast as a star system. The ships’ onboard AIs analyzed the safe landing sites for each vessel by scanning the contours of the folded mountain ranges. As more and more ships landed, the air within the cavity gradually became more humid. Feeling the increasingly distinct pulsations within her lower body, the young girl couldn’t help but grow slightly moist; she knew this was a sign that the little ones were beginning to build their city. But for the colonists, this was far from enough—the flagship plunged deep into the cavity, reaching the very entrance to her cervix.\""
