on of civilization, you...are the last hope of civilization...\nOur army is making a final stand, buying every second for your evacuation.\nWith the highest respect, I express my deep gratitude to our warriors who fought to their last moment...\nLastly...\n...(A long silence)\nMay the Goddess bless us...\nThis holographic projection ends with the former planet leader's last sigh which looks somewhat laughable.\nIt seems that all this information confirms our original assumptions, this prosperous and unified planet, this paradise planet belonging to small people, came to an end under the amusement of a certain small giantess.\nIt's as simple as stepping on bugs.\nThe so-called resistance and courage of the small people to us is no more than a bunch of bugs that are trying to climb our ankles in vain and ignorance."
