-  gts_aplog.1027.desc: "\"We’ve arrived, meow~\"\n\nIt’s unknown whether Yanxi’s charming voice was directed at Apro or the humans that were \"appreciating\" the broadcast but, because of that call, over half of the humans still alive and watching that broadcast on this planet had increased the intensity of their grip because of that one coquettish exclamation.\n\nThat also included the people in country A.\n\nMany of them had launched their most intense yet futile resistance - before reaching the target city, countless fire power had rained down, the most effective among which was the high-yield nuclear weapons of the sea’s forces, which successfully scratched Yanxi’s ankle.\n\nThat little point of light did successfully catch the goddess’s attention, but in just a few minutes, Yanxi walked from one end of this planet to the other. The collateral damage she caused along the way was even more terrifying than the most brutal war on this planet. But to some extent, if you take a look at their actions, these actions were rather gentle-after all, the civilization on this planet believed in the law of the jungle, and both Yanxi and Apro could crush the planet with one finger or put it in their shoes to slowly \"enjoy\", but they didn’t, that was certainly a gentle act.\n\n\"Was it around here...\"\n\nYanxi crouched down and started to take off her shoes – To her it could be considered a sort of ritual. Of course, to Yanxi, who had entered a state of \"rigor mortis\", the troops of Country A, who were still struggling to keep their morale up, started their last suicidal attacks.\n\nHowever, even the land-based tactical nuclear weapons could barely touch Yanxi's silk stocking, while the rest of the land forces could only watch in despair at the black mountain in front of them ... It was a majestic existence that they will never even surpass in their lives.\n\n\"Hmm… It’s a little hot, meow~\"\n\nFinally Yanxi slipped off her heels and socks, letting her feet make familiar contact with the ground. She let the city of humans be a way for her feet, which were already getting moist, to relax-Apro’s gasps nearby also still managed to retain their vigor.\n\n\"You bastard, quickly release me... \"\n\nUnfortunately, before Apro could finish her words, she saw Yanxi's foot came back-from her angle, she could see that the pure white sole was now covered in bits of black city debris and scraps from armored vehicles, Apro could even see the bits of trash falling like hailstones as Yanxi teased them by shaking her foot.\n\n\"Sorry, meow...\"\n\nYanxi chuckled shook her head, and then dropped her foot into another city -Even someone with an iron will wouldn’t have the heart to crush it again after hearing that big cat moaning for more than ten minutes, right?\n\n\"You can come out for now, I’ll see what we should play next.\"\n\nWhile Yanxi was fiddling with her phone and starting the next poll, Apro, feeling vengeful, crushed the city that Yanxi trapped her in inside her high heel into mud and then stepped into a new urban complex. Although she could not compare to Yanxi, who was now at 10k meters tall, even a body at 1000 meters was still absolutely fatal to this civilization-not to mention that the big cat was now a ball of rage, this time she was going to crush the city of those small people to vent her anger. There was nothing she cared about more than being able to bully the weak with her nature.\n\n\"Why are there so many votes for the sex option...\"\n\nYanxi glanced at the surrounding cities with some disdain. If they were to do it at her current size along with her beloved little slut-cat, then the entire city would be submerged in two of their juices... Yanxi suddenly realized something was wrong, the little slut-cat was at 1000 meters right now, she wasn't even bigger than the giant beast beneath her…. In Yanxi's original plan, the little slut-cat who was supposed to be penetrated was blissfully unaware at this point, she was still walking leisurely among this \"huge\" urban complex, greeting the resistance forces of Country A, \"\
-    Hydrogen Peroxide Uracil Arsenic\"\n\n\"You trash! Vermin! Microbes! All go and die, meow!!!\"\n\nApro casually swung her cat tail, pulling down buildings that humans called high rises, turning the fruits of their labor and painstaking effort into garbage that caused secondary disasters. However, even in the face of such desperate scenes, there were still a number of people who actually dared to put up a fight. The lucky ones were either buried or smashed into meat paste by the collateral damage of the cat tail, and the unlucky, they were either grabbed by Apro and thrown into her mouth, like sprinkling sugar- most of them only had their limbs remaining due to Apro’s violent actions– or they were just completely flattened by the dirty foot pad of Apro, becoming a part of her dirty footprint.\n\n\"Hahaha! All of you shall become my slaves!\"\n\nHowever, such cruel behavior was quickly stopped, as it was not that Apro suddenly became kind and let these bugs go, or even that they had launched an attack to hurt that goddess who was only 1000 meters tall. What happened was the cat who was wildly causing destruction was propelled up into the air.\n\nThe great cat who was just flexing her power was thrown up and then caught in her hands.\n\n\"Yan!xi! Hah!!!\""
