od is not to be mocked. What a man sows, he also reaps. Bar me not, old man, your toys violated the accords.\"§!\n\nReflecting on the distant hopeful lovers, she idly raised the apple.\n\n§r\"To freedom.\"§!\n\nThen, promptly took a wholehearted bite."
