 knees. However, the little lamb, whose mind was filled with drowsiness, seemed to remember something, and clamped her legs together and gently rubbed them.\n\n「Uhm, I can't take them off here, if there's a starship passing by, they'll see everything」\n\nShe tucked the panties back into the shadow of the leggings. Also trapped in the leggings were a few small planets. The black silk threads were like a huge net covering the sky, driving the lost stars into the cotton blanket under the little lamb's panties, in that hormonally soothing comforter. \n\nEverything was light and airy. Worries and thoughts slipped away quietly, just like the pink sheep in Siesta at dusk...\n\n「It feels like a cloud when I touch it, but... I can even hold a nebula in one hand now」\n\nEyjafjalla stretched out her hand, went around that dense nebula. Then, her pinkish-white background appeared again, and this dark red nebula also became the embellishment between the little lamb's fingers.\n\n「It seems like something is still missing...」 Her palm moved slightly, and finally, the nebula stopped on the ring finger of Eyjafjalla's right hand. The nebula, captured by the little lamb's finger, cast a bright red light on her skin, making the fingers, which already seemed as white as scallions, appear rosy. As if she had remembered something, Eyjafjalla's face could not help but show a suppressed smile...\n\n「Phew, good night, tiny nebula...」 Eyjafjalla reluctantly pulled her hand back, and gently entered her dreams"
