\n\"Hah - ! Hah - ! *Cough, cough, cough!!*\" \nYou bolted upright from your chair, like a drowning man reaching the surface, greedily gulping the cold air. The stifling claustrophobia, the touch of that scalding, viscous liquid, and the searing pain of being dissolved by acid... all vanished in an instant. In their place was the stinging white light of your office. This wasn't the foul-smelling stomach; it was your all-too-familiar Supreme Commander's Office. You were drenched in cold sweat, as if just pulled from water. You looked down at your trembling hands - not digested, not turned to pulp, even your clothes were intact. \nA voice, part mocking and part haughty, drifted from your desk. \n\"Letting out a scream like you're being eaten right here in the office... isn't that a bit embarrassing?\" You looked up stiffly. Double-Mooned Hitomi was sitting on the edge of your desk. She wore her familiar maid outfit, her long legs crossed, toes wiggling playfully in the air. \n\"It seems you had a nightmare?\" Hitomi leaned forward slightly, her exquisite face nearing yours, her lips curled in a demonic smile. She hopped off the desk, walked behind your chair, and draped her arms around your neck, hugging you lightly from behind. She leaned into your ear and whispered: \n\"Dear master must remember... never, ever let your maid kitten down~\""
