, half of its inhabitants, half of its creations, and half of their dreams, we could only conclude that it could, and perhaps even should have been worse.\n\nWe're unsure if this will make the situation better or worse."
   gts_hoppo.12.a: "...What can we do? We will rebuild our homes. Hopefully the help of that *Harbor* will compensate for our losses."
   gts_hoppo.12.tooltip: "§REverything was crushed. It's not game over, but it's real suffering.§!"
