-  # Original: “哈？你不给——那我可就要自己来拿了，要是你敢让人来阻止我……我可是会让他们一块去死的呢，为你们着想，不要试着反抗我哦～♡”\n\n“让我瞧瞧看，这次用什么体型呢～”\n\n画面里林凤那庞大的身躯消失了，接着画面便切换到了§Y[event_target:gts_linfeng_target_planet.GetName]§!上——为什么……我们的视角是在一栋大楼的楼顶上？\n\n一阵剧烈的震动从远方传来，那剧烈的震动伴随着不断轰鸣着的巨响不断逼近，城区当中的建筑在这愈发剧烈的震动下不断的颤抖着，时不时的就会出现一栋大楼当场倒塌，就连我们所看到的画面也一同不停地颤动着……\n\n“真是的，差点就没找到你们了呢，这种场景不让你们看可真的是有些可惜了”\n\n一阵更为剧烈的震动袭来，还没等那震动缓解我们便看见了造成这一切的罪魁祸首出现在了我们的眼前——林凤的高跟靴此刻正以被放大了万倍的大小出现在了我们的面前，这画面的清晰度让我们能够清楚的看见她的高跟靴在降临时将一架正在飞行客机当场碾入靴低，甚至连爆炸的火花都没来得及产生便被她完全踏进了大地之中\n\n废墟，一片又一片的废墟在她的巨靴之下不断蔓延，她只是站在原地轻轻跺了跺脚，所产生的震动便向四处蔓延，令周围的建筑一环接一环的坍塌\n\n“嗯～我觉得嘛，你们肯定不会只看我的鞋子吧，所以……”\n\n林凤轻轻拉下了她高跟靴后方的拉链，然后将自己的丝足从靴子的包裹中缓缓取出，放在了已被她的双足践踏成废墟的城市之中\n\n那被黑色的丝袜包裹着的玉足渐渐出现在了我们的视野中，透过相互交错着的纤维缝隙我们能清楚的看到她的足部皮肤——白嫩、水润，让人忍不住想要扑上去舔……咳咳！\n\n“嗯哼～？你心里在想什么我可是一清二楚的呢，呐，§E[ROOT.Ruler.GetName]§!给你一个近距离欣赏的机会～”\n\n然后，林凤便轻轻抬起了她的脚，就像是在刻意为我们展示一样的将整只脚的足底部分都暴露在了我们的面前，那被黑色丝袜包裹着的玉足上沾满了城市残骸，在那些残骸中甚至还有幸存者正在挣扎着想要爬出覆满了肉酱的废墟……\n\n“欣赏够了么？那么，和他们说再见吧～♡”\n\n林凤的脚掌迅速碾向那未被破坏的城区，我们所能看见的视野在几秒内便被她的足底完全覆盖，我们听见了一些惨叫声与求饶声，接着画面便被切断，可以想象到那片大陆上的人们接下来将会经历怎样的场景……为那些牺牲的人们祈祷吧，至少他们为我们换来了她的帮助
-  gts_linfeng.103.desc: "“Ha? You won't give it to me—then I'll have to take it myself. If you dare to let anyone stop me... I will make them die together. For your sake, don't try to resist me~♡”\n\n“Let me see, what size for this time~”\n\nThe massive figure of Linfeng disappeared from the screen, and then the view switched to §Y[event_target:gts_linfeng_target_planet.GetName]§!—why... is our perspective on the roof of a building?\n\nA violent tremor came from afar. The violent tremor accompanied by the constantly roaring loud noise was approaching constantly. The buildings in the city were constantly trembling under this increasingly violent tremor. Occasionally, a building would collapse on the spot, even the picture we saw was trembling together...\n\n“Really, almost couldn't find you. It would be a pity not to let you see this scene.”\n\nA more violent tremor hit. Before the tremor subsided, we saw the culprit causing all this appearing in front of us—Linfeng's high-heeled boot appeared in front of us at a size magnified ten thousand times at this moment. The clarity of this picture allowed us to clearly see that her high-heeled boot crushed a flying airliner into the sole on the spot when descending, even being completely stepped into the ground by her before the explosion sparks could generate.\n\nRuins, patch after patch of ruins spreading constantly under her giant boots. She just stood there and stomped her feet gently, the vibration produced spread everywhere, causing the surrounding buildings to collapse ring by ring.\n\n“Mmhmm~ I think, you definitely won't just look at my shoes, so...”\n\nLinfeng gently pulled down the zipper on the back of her high-heeled boots, then slowly took her silk feet out of the boots wrapped around them, placing them in the city which had been trampled into ruins by her feet.\n\nThe jade feet wrapped in black silk stockings gradually appeared in our field of vision. Through the intersecting fiber gaps, we could clearly see the skin of her feet—white, tender, moist, making people unable to resist wanting to pounce on and lick... Cough cough!\n\n“Mmhmm~? I know exactly what you are thinking. Here, §E[ROOT.Ruler.GetName]§!, a chance for you to admire up close~”\n\nThen, Linfeng gently lifted her foot, exposing the entire sole part of her foot in front of us as if deliberately showing off. The jade foot wrapped in black silk stockings was covered with city debris, and within those debris, there were even survivors struggling to crawl out of the ruins covered with meat paste...\n\n“Admired enough? Then, say goodbye to them~♡”\n\nLinfeng's sole quickly crushed towards the undamaged city area. The view we could see was completely covered by her sole in a few seconds. We heard some screams and begging for mercy, then the picture was cut off. We can imagine what kind of scene the people on that continent will experience next... Pray for those who sacrificed, at least they exchanged for her help for us."
