-  gts_linfeng.100.desc: "“Linfeng requests communication”\n\nSuch words appear on the communication panel. Compared to others, she is quite polite.\nShe probably came to you with good news...\n\n*Connect communication\nJust as you connected the communication, a virtual display screen seemingly made of psionic energy appeared beside you simultaneously. Looks like this is also Linfeng's ability.\n\n“It's been a bit boring lately... so—I came here~”\n\nThrough that display screen, you see Linfeng is currently in a system within your empire territory, and she is currently maintaining celestial-level size. She is holding the only habitable planet in that system in her arms. However, it seems she hasn't caused destruction to the planet, appearing to protect it with her special psionic energy.\n\n“However, I am very merciful. You can choose to hand over some population to me in exchange for the safety of this planet. A very worthwhile deal, right~?”\n\nRather than a deal, it's more like forced buying and selling."
