+  gts_linfeng.123.desc: "\"Tsk... you guys are perseverant in some aspects, well, just right, I am also a little 'fiery' right now, might as well use your planet to release it~\"\n\nLinfeng gently lifted her short skirt, revealing the terrifying monster hidden under the skirt - a massive object already standing upright, a thick meat rod with popping veins.\n\n\"Mmhmm~?\"\n\nLinfeng stroked the meat rod under her crotch with her hand, slowly aiming it at §Y[event_target:gts_linfeng_target_planet.GetName]§!. A few drops of precum emitting a fishy smell dripped from the meat rod onto the planet's surface, destroying many cities.\n\nShe gazed at this tiny planet. That gaze revealing erotic atmosphere swept every inch of the planet. In her eyes, this poor planet was completely the perfect container for sperm collection. After all, habitable planets developed like this with sufficient population are rare to see~\n\nLinfeng gently cupped this planet with her huge palm, keeping it firmly controlled by her palm completely in front of her majestic genitals. Then she slowly used the other hand to stroke massive asteroids over and then held her own meat rod to jerk gently, grinding those asteroids as granules for fun, incidentally slowly bringing the meat rod close to the surface, sharing that obscene heat unreservedly with the people living on it - regardless of whether they can accept it.\n\nLinfeng slowly thrust her incredibly huge waist, controlling that thick giant object emitting a strong fishy smell to rub on the planet's surface. As the thick giant object vibrated violently and trembled occasionally, the entire planet trembled together due to her masturbation activity. People on the planet witnessed this terrifying act easily changing the planet's landscape but were completely powerless against it. People could only watch with their own eyes as Linfeng wiped out everything on the planet with her meat rod, watching her use her meat rod to constantly distort and deform the land and atmosphere and then destroy them.\n\n\"Done very well~ Then... here it comes~\"\n\nAs soon as the voice fell, a stream of white slurry emitting a thick fishy smell erupted from the urethra, enveloping the entire planet in the shadow of this thick sperm in an instant. Thick and sticky semen swallowed the cities on the surface completely like an ocean descending from the sky. Massive sticky white turbid liquid spread slowly in space, then constantly distorted its trajectory under Linfeng's mighty power, gradually turning into a spectacular scene like a planetary ring.\n\nA planetary ring made of a beautiful girl's semen... interesting.\n\nAs for the people on the planet... unfortunately, for those beast-like sperms, they are food. Our subjects were preyed upon by Linfeng's \"offspring\" as food, and our cities were easily destroyed by her masturbation...\n\nAt least, she didn't destroy the planet completely. After rebuilding, this planet will have a better future... probably"
