t fell in completely\n\n“As for why using you—just because it's fun”\n\nOther human voices came from the video at this time. It seems the crew on the engineering ship found the abnormally activated recording function\n\n“How to open the recording... Oh my god...”\n\n“What the hell, let me see... Heavens... Maintain silence! Don't let her find us...”\n\n“Should be done recording right~? Next—time to 'turn off' the video”\n\nThen, the first perspective of the video approached her body constantly. Judging from the screams constantly coming from around, the engineering ship should have been forcibly pulled to her side by some special power of hers, and the crew inside died in this process\n\nThen, we saw her sending the engineering ship towards her lower body...\n\nEven in a slightly opened state, it is so huge. This size, even if we put our planet in, probably can't meet her needs...\n\nFinally, the content of the video only left pink tender meat hole folds, and occasional soft moans from outside..."
