y firmly pressed against Linfeng's black-silk-wrapped jade foot, which emitted a strong scent.\n\"Shh. Don't speak, just watch well, just smell well.\"\nLinfeng suddenly applied force, that giant black-silk-wrapped foot stepping on the back of Hitomi's head like a stepping stone, bringing Hitomi's head crashing down toward the presidential palace below, which symbolized supreme power. Hitomi let out a heart-wrenching scream, but to no avail. Her face was forced tightly against the ground, and in her field of vision were her terrified fleeing compatriots. And above her head was that giant black-silk-wrapped sole mercilessly applying pressure. No miracles occurred. Hitomi's exquisite face was slammed into the ground under the giant force of Linfeng's sole. She personally watched her cheek crush the dome of the presidential palace, personally experiencing the sensation of millions of people instantly turning into meat paste. The entire capital city was thus hard-grinded into a giant sunken pit by Linfeng stepping on Hitomi's head.\nLinfeng looked at this \"masterpiece\" beneath her foot with satisfaction, her toes rubbing gently over Hitomi's head through the black silk, as if wiping off the dust stained on her sole."
