   gts_linfeng.224.name: "Unknown Pink Threat"
-  #  林凤的每一步跨出，都伴随着地壳板块的哀鸣。在将总统府踏成深坑后，她似乎还没玩够，控制着质量微微悬浮在半空，开始借着首都星上的各大摩天大楼“清理”起了脚底。\n被踩在林凤脚底的希瞳，只觉得像是有一块行星级别的巨石正隔着自己的头颅与大地摩擦。林凤脚尖每划过一栋楼宇，希瞳都能感觉到那些坚硬的钢筋水泥在林凤足底那惊人的质量下瞬间粉碎，将原本已经破碎不堪的建筑残骸连同里面数以百万计的生命，化为更加细腻的齑粉。\n“希瞳酱，看呀，你的这些‘小人’朋友们，正在很努力地帮我清理脚底呢……是不是很可爱？”\n希瞳已经无法发声，金色的眸子里满是血泪，绝望地看着这个正在被毁掉的世界。帝国舰娘引以为傲的“绝对防御”，在这个次元之外的女神面前，简直是一个残酷的笑话。她只能感觉到林凤那温润潮湿的肌肤触感，以及那股混合着血腥味的、独属于女神的浓郁汗香。\n终于，林凤似乎玩够了。她随手一踢，将一栋原本是首都星最高建筑的残骸像踢石子一样踢入外太空，然后抬起了脚，露出了那个原本是文明中心、如今只剩下一片暗红色的凹陷深坑。\n“那么，小看家犬，我给你一个选择的机会……是打算继续为这些‘虫子’效力，还是说……往后永远地成为我的‘玩具’呢？”
-  gts_linfeng.224.desc: "Linfeng's footsteps were accompanied by the wails of tectonic plates. After trampling the presidential palace into a deep pit, she didn't seem satisfied. She controlled her mass to gently hover in mid-air and began to 'clean' her soles with the help of various skyscrapers on the capital planet.\\nHitomi, whose head was pressed against Linfeng's sole, felt as if she was being grinded against the crust of the earth by a planet-sized boulder. Every building Linfeng's foot brushed past felt like a giant razor, shredding the few remaining architectural remains beneath her and further pulverizing the millions of lives into dust.\\n\"Hitomi-chan, look at how hard your 'tiny' friends are working to clean my feet... aren't they adorable?\"\\nHitomi could no longer speak, her golden eyes were overflowing with blood and tears, looking hopelessly at the world being destroyed. The proud 'Absolute Defense' of the Imperial Shipgirl had become a cruel joke before this goddess from another dimension. She could only feel the warm, moist touch of Linfeng's skin and the thick, suffocating scent of the goddess's sweat mixed with the metallic smell of blood.\\nFinally, Linfeng seemed to have played enough. She lightly kicked, sending the remains of the capital planet's highest building flying into space like a pebble, then she lifted her foot, revealing the deep pit that used to be the heart of a civilization.\\n\"Now, little watchdog, I'll give you a chance to choose... do you want to continue serving those 'insects', or do you want to become my 'toy' forever?\""
