-  gts_paopao.2.desc: "Yaorong named the 'little amoeba' Bubble, and the very few who worshiped Leviathan creatures called her the Goddess of the Night.\nLittle Bubble grew quickly, although still inferior to the growth rate of your children, compared to her kind... this amoeba, who was often hugged and rubbed by Yaorong's head and breasts, seemed to be growing well. And, as if because the two little ones often stuck together to play, the amoeba called Bubble has already taken on some of Yaorong's characteristics – at least the Empire has never seen a space amoeba that could transform into a human.\n§P“Daddy-'§!\n§g“……'§!\nThe sky-covering young girl descended from the sky, and under her armpit was a much smaller... little loli? Anyway, her sister, your other daughter, would never want to be pinned under her elder sister’s armpit.\n§P“Look, Bubble can also transform!'§!\nYaorong seemed very happy, but every time she was so happy, she would become silly. For example, she hadn't had time to put the little girl under her arm down, and she also forgot that her height of tens of thousands of meters only allowed her father to see her heel.\n§Y“Put her down.'§!\nAlthough her vision is filled with her child's black high heels and the shadows she casts, you are already used to it – at least this girl didn't yell and stomp down from the sky, crushing a city with millions of people or flattening an industrial park with a single foot.\nThis is already a great improvement, right?\n§P“Uh-huh! Bubble, this is my daddy, and also your... um... Daddy, what should she call you?'§!\nThe little dragon cub put down the Bubble, which was thousands of meters tall, while continuing to mutter. And the amoeba miss, being a space creature, obviously hadn't adjusted to her 'master’s' mindset. After all, in those past years, besides learning the art of transformation with this master and her equally large sister, she hadn't done anything else.\n§g“Master.'§!\nAfter landing safely, the amoeba girl didn't greet you immediately, but turned and gave a great salute to your dragon cub. Her voice was very soft, but her pronunciation wasn't very clear... but this was normal. This girl had finally managed to transform into a human shape, and before she had time to learn to speak she was put into a maid outfit by her master, and then, like a dog with a good find, was brought to this small planet under the armpit of her master.\nBubble naturally had some feelings, and so did you. Originally, only your daughter’s black high heels occupied your entire vision, but now there was a skirt you had never seen before, gently swaying less than a hundred meters above you... If it were just the skirt like a silk curtain gently swaying, that would be fine, but that skirt could crush the Empire’s army vehicles if it landed!\n§P“Bubble! Be careful not to step on my dad!'§!\nDespite your little princess shouting excitedly, without any sign of lady-like behavior, the already bowing Bubble did not move her body. After all, even the most indifferent creature could, after more than a year together, know what kind of personality her “master' had-she was a father-con to the point of being irrational and so powerful she could not be resisted……girl.\n§g“Yes, master.'§!\nAfter receiving permission from Yaorong, Bubble finally stood up - compared to her daughter’s always proud and out-of-proportion body, this space amoeba miss is just barely up to Yaorong’s knees, but even Yaorong’s knees are several thousand meters high! A giantess several thousand meters tall turning from a kneeling to a standing position in front of you…\nYou were numb to it.\nBut thankfully, this newborn girl didn't cause you any harm, and after confirming that you were the father that Yaorong had been thinking of, Bubble hid very timidly behind Yaorong’s calf. It was obvious that the girl was very afraid of you, and you don't know what Yaorong told this little one about you. \n§P“Bubble, you can't be so rude... don't be afraid, daddy, no matter how powerful he is, he's just that small-hey, daddy, don't look at me like
