-  gts_leader_qhai.80.desc: "‘This ceiling is too familiar.’\n\n[event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] slowly awakens from the soft, humid walls of the womb, first wiping away the fluids from her face, then swallowing the slippery love nectar that she ingested, then she abruptly opens her eyes. The sight before her was still Qianhai's pink uterus wall. The membranous wall moving to and fro in response to Qianhai's breath seems to be mocking her for how powerless she has become. \n\nShe sat up slowly, only for [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName]'s eyelids drooped again; Qianhai's uterus was so warm. The thin layer of love nectar exuded an intoxicating perfume, and the girl's calming and ever-present groans of internal organs lulled her into a feeling of sleepiness.\n\n'Ugh, is it daytime yet?'\n\nThe imprisoned titaness girl slaps her face, forcing herself to wake. Through her skin that was pressing against the soft flesh walls, she can clearly feel the accelerated heartbeat of Qianhai. It is soon after that the succubus girl awakens. [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] understands that her body's circadian rhythm had merged with Qianhai's; when the girl is awake, that is her daytime.\n\nWeirdly enough, [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] has been hearing guttural flesh on flesh sounds in her digestive track. It seems like there was something roaming within her body. \n\n§r'Haa, ugh, good morning.'§!\n\nQianhai's booming voice pierced the walls and disrupted [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName]'s thought process. The tiny world she resides in started to shake as the owner from her tiny world has awoken. And so begins her unconscious shifting and adjusting.\n\nThe uterine walls in front of her began its rhythmic compression. Once the wall depresses, the opposite wall lifts in response. Moving around on the uterus floor is not difficult, the sudden and forceful compression on her made it impossible to move on the floor. It was a part of Qianhai’s daily morning routine of rubbing her abdomen.\n\n§r'Mmm, that’s right. [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] is so full of energy today.'§!\n\n'Next time, please don't do it again, Qianhai Mama.'\n\n[event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] weakly responds to Qianhai's words after being released from the clutches of her uterus. The girl did great, however after the routine she has lost all of her energy. Not like the succubus girl would care for her proposal.\n\n§r'Ah, that reminds me, you have a new neighbor to meet.'§!\n\n'Neighbor?'\n\n§r'You’ll see when you come out. Hmm, it looks a little difficult. I'll come for you~'§!\n\nEven if [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] had questions, going outside would always be a great option. She has had many nights where she tried to sneak out only to find the excited flesh walls of the tiny hole to drag her back in. \n\n[event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] slides her body through the tiny pink opening, before her. The tightly packed flesh, that was once akin to a gate, has now opened up a little. It was obviously Qianhai actively controlling her body’s instinctual responses. After a short trip, [event_target:gts_qhai_daughter.GetName] went into free fall after a strong pulse from her uterus."
