e was incredibly careful. Qianhai places the tiny planet inside her armpit and uses her warm, red skin to wedge it inside safely. The cold object caused her to grow uncomfortable, and she had a strong urge to rub the round object with her arm. But she overcame her desires, otherwise, the wisher would not have seen the light of day. The planet was now completely in the dark. For the first time, after several decades the planet's light is no longer obtainable. But instead of causing cold and dread, the planet was now getting hotter at an alarming rate. The planet's shield began to shake ferociously, and as they could no longer watch it, shattered. The dark flesh around the planet had not one scratch on their planet showing that she was showing them mercy."
 
