-  gts_leader_qhai.601.desc: "The succubus girl appears before the empire’s star system without warning. Compared to the last time, she was significantly smaller, but her body was big enough to make the empire’s capital planet look small. But for this plan to work it only needed to be a little bit bigger than Yaorong. \n\n§r'Hehe, Sneaky.'§!\n\nThe purple gems at the tip of her tail produced a strange aura that caused all of the empire’s sensors to stop functioning for now. Even Yaorong’s sensory organs would be unable to sense anything. With a smile, the girl started to move closer to Yaorong. \n\nThe small dragon was wearing a red, black, and white dress and was floating in space, her long tail waiving, destroying space debris that came into her way.   \n\n*Her tail is waiving like a little dog,* Qianhai thinks to herself.\n\nYaorong’s burning pupils were watching her father work. It is very likely that even if the universe was to die, she would always be like this. Yaorong then would pick off the fools that dare to start something as she was keeping a watchful eye.\n\nSuddenly, Yaorong felt a chilling sensation. The feeling she had never felt before. Then she was slammed into soft flesh. Her vision was instantly taken over.\n\n§P'Ugh, ugh, ughh.’§!\n\n§r'Hehe, how's it, little dragon? Even if my chest is not the biggest, it is big enough to use as a prison~'§!\n\nQianhai pulls at her white shirt which was keeping her breasts prisoner. She used both of her hands to compress her breast, and as she did, the white flesh starts to push against Yaorong.. The smell of the succubus filled Yaorong's mouth and nose. All she could do is let out weak grunts. But she had to act. She could not forget that she was being attacked by the large woman who had become a leader, It should have been called Qianhai.\n\n§P'Ughh!'§!\n\nBut Yaorong had no intention of accepting defeat, letting out an angry grumble. Her hair was turning a golden colour, and her body was pushing against the 