-  gts_seele.74.desc: "We transported the minerals waiting to be processed into space. High-quality raw ores floated in the zero-gravity environment, awaiting §B［Seele］§!’s further processing.\n\n§B‘Need help with these? §B［Seele］§! can handle it.’§! Her feet enveloped the surrounding space, the soles covered in accumulated dirt and crystalline sweat, undoubtedly improving the quantity and quality of the extracted minerals. Her slender feet slowly closed together, crushing the scattered minerals beneath them. The transport ships that hadn’t left yet were caught between her toes, mixed with the minerals, dirt, and sweat. Perhaps a lucky ship could get stuck in §B［Seele］§!’s foot wrinkles, enjoying this scene from a first-person perspective.\n\nAs §B［Seele］§! increased the pressure, more sweat seeped from between her toes, soaking the minerals in a lewd scent. Under continuous squeezing, the density of the raw ores increased, fully mixing with the dirt, while the giantess’s bodily fluids replaced the original impurities, further enhancing the quality of the alloy. Her feet slowly rubbed against each other, and countless sweat-soaked alloys fell from her soles, exuding the scent of sweat and foot odor. Although some minerals hadn’t been fully processed, the efficiency far exceeded normal methods. Besides the alloy, we might be able to collect some by-products?"
