-  #  “唔…另一个我，你又带我到什么地方来了。”看着底下蓝绿相间的地块，白希有些不知所措，这样的场景只有她与黑希在星海遨游时见过，但那些小小的星球根本不可能让她们有机会降临在上面。\n“这可是我专门为你准备的礼物～”带着坏笑的黑希向着白希走去，本应坚固的地面却被二十万倍的黑希踩出一个又一个足型坑洞，对于星球的小人们来说，这样的坑洞是巨大的灾难，不仅仅是其中溢出的岩浆，还有那被数百万吨的重量压实的泥土，但他们很快就不需要考虑这些了…\n“另一个我！”\n白希的话音还未落下，黑希的玉足就已经落在了地上，而脚印两边赫然分布着一座巨型城市，作为沿海的商业港口，大量的人口居住在其中，灾难来临时，他们早已聚集在地下的防空洞内，祈求着脆弱的工事能挡住黑希的毁灭，但黑希根本不会给他们机会，她早就看到了人们在哪里，并且精准的踩中了人口最多的数十个防空洞，上千万人被神明的力量所踩中，这裹挟着头顶泥土的力量瞬间将他们掩埋，尸体与血液在泥土中爆开，而没有躲进防空洞内的人们，要么在楼房内被碎裂的建筑所覆盖，要么“幸运”地与黑希的脚掌来了个亲密接触，但无一例外，他们都被希儿碾成肉泥。\n“你…”\n白希从未如此近距离看过这恐怖的一幕，即使曾经对星球的毁灭也仅仅是弹指一瞬，然而对微生物们的屠杀还在继续，似乎是为了让白希再看一次一般，黑希的脚向左右扫动，虽不如落脚的深度，但这样的破坏依然摧毁了小人们幸存的城市，而看着这一切的白希脑子一片空白，她仿佛能听到城市里人们的哀嚎与求饶，不过黑希此时已经来到了她的面前。\n“怎么啦，你还对这些虫子抱有怜悯吗？”坐下来的黑希无意间又压扁了一座城市，不过这对于城市里的百万人来说或许是件好事，如果他们看到了黑希接下来的行为，他们甚至会感谢黑希赐予了他们瞬间死亡。“没…没有。”不太想扰乱黑希兴致的白希只能违心地回答，但接下来黑希却环抱着她，慢慢躺了下来。\n“这颗星球很适合做我们的游乐场呢，恒星的光芒与温度刚好合适，地面也挺软的，还有这么多小虫子陪我们一起～”带着坏笑的黑希将脑袋轻轻放上白希的肩膀，享受着另一个自己身上少女的芬芳，而不断轰炸着她们的空军与轨道舰队则被随手扇毁，或是被黑希轻轻捏住，按碎在白希的身体上。\n“你看，即使你什么都不做，这些小虫子们也会被你的一举一动给杀死呢。”黑希笑着揉了揉白希的鼻子，就在刚刚，星球上的军队出动了所有的空军，但刚飞过白希的鼻子时就被呼吸所破坏，无数的钢铁巨兽炸开在白希的鼻孔旁，而海军，则早在白希将脚放入海洋中时，就与黑希的玉足一起将舰队搅碎了。\n“怎么样，我的服务还不错吧～”轻轻揉捏着白希的胸口，黑希的另一只手不老实的向白希身下伸去，而当白皙反应过来时，裙子已经被掀开，甚至胖次都要被扒开。\n“别！”脸羞红的白希摇了摇头，试图挡住黑希的手，但并没有什么效果，黑希只是随手一拍，白希也只能乖乖将手移开，任由黑希的手指伸进去。\n触碰到白希蜜穴的一瞬间，白希突然颤抖了一下，这对身下撤离的小人们来说可是不小的灾难，强烈的地震瞬间撕裂了大地，无数的小人掉进了那幽深的裂痕中，而接下来，一次又一次的震动将他们的下面完全变成了无人区。\n“好好看着，虫子们，这说不定是你们最后一次欣赏少女的私处了呢～”黑希一边挑弄这身下的虫子，一边双指继续在白希的蜜穴当中搅动，而白希从原本压抑的轻哼，逐渐变为一段一段的叫声，从十万倍躯体内发出的音波让近处的小人们瞬间炸开成一团团血雾，而即使是离希儿很远的，也无可避免的被这声音击穿了耳膜，不断流出鲜血。\n“对，就是这样。”黑希手上动作越发快速，抽查的力气也越来越大，白希的爱液造就在下面形成了一片高于地表的湖泊，流动的液体同样淹没着身下的一切，幸存者连同着他们的城市一起被粘稠的爱液淹没，破坏，并流入了海洋之中。\n“啊！！！”一声超越宇宙中一切声音的浪叫传遍了整颗星球，白希的爱液从蜜穴中瞬间冲出，白色的胖次拦下了大多数的液体，但仍有一部分液体顺着大陆流进海里，让海岸线变成了一片爱液的海洋。\n“嗯～咸咸的。”黑希将沾满爱液的手指轻轻伸进嘴里品尝后，随手抹在了一旁的城市上，而身旁的白希早已满脸羞红，或许在少女休息过后，这颗星球也难逃毒手吧…
-  gts_seele.226.desc: "\"Mmm... my other self, where have you taken me this time?\" Looking at the blue and green tiles below, White Seele was at a loss; she and Black Seele had only seen such scenes while traveling through the sea of stars, but those tiny planets could never provide them an opportunity to descend upon them. \\n\\n\"This is a gift I specially prepared for you~\" With a wicked smile, Black Seele walked toward White Seele. The supposedly solid ground was stomped into one foot-shaped crater after another by the 200,000-times enlarged Black Seele. For the little people on the planet, these craters were massive disasters—not only for the overflowing lava but also for the soil compacted by millions of tons of weight. But they soon wouldn't need to worry about that... \\n\\n\"My other self!\" \\n\\nBefore White Seele could finish her sentence, Black Seele's jade feet had already landed on the ground. Flanking the footprint was a giant city; as a coastal commercial port, it housed a large population. When the disaster struck, they had already gathered in underground air-raid shelters, praying that the fragile works could block Black Seele's destruction. But Black Seele wouldn't give them a chance; she had long seen where the people were and precisely stomped on dozens of the most populated shelters. Tens of millions were crushed by the divine power, the force compacting the soil above and burying them instantly—bodies and blood exploding within the earth. Those who hadn't reached shelters were either covered by collapsing buildings or 'lucky' enough to have a close encounter with Black Seele's sole. Without exception, Seele ground them into meat paste. \\n\\n\"You...\" \\n\\nWhite Seele had never seen such a terrifying scene so closely, even though destroying a planet once took only a flick of a finger. Yet the slaughter of microorganisms continued; as if to let White Seele see it again, Black Seele's feet swept left and right. Though not as deep as the initial stomp, this destruction still leveled the little people's surviving cities. White Seele's mind went blank as she watched, seemingly hearing the wails and pleas for mercy from the cities. But Black Seele had now come before her. \\n\\n\"What's wrong? Do you still have pity for these bugs?\" Sitting down, Black Seele inadvertently flattened another city. Though for the millions in that city, perhaps it was a mercy; if they saw Black Seele's next actions, they might even thank her for granting them an instant death. \"N-no.\" Not wanting to ruin Black Seele's mood, White Seele could only answer against her conscience. But then Black Seele embraced her and slowly lay down. \\n\\n\"This planet is perfect as our playground. The star's light and temperature are just right, the ground is soft, and there are so many little bugs to keep us company~\" With a smirk, Black Seele gently rested her head on White Seele's shoulder, enjoying the girl's fragrance from her other self. The air forces and orbital fleets continuously bombing them were swatted away or caught by Black Seele and crushed against White Seele's body. \\n\\n\"See? Even if you do nothing, these little bugs will be killed by your every movement.\" Black Seele smiled and rubbed White Seele's nose. Just then, the planet's military deployed all its air forces, but as they flew past White Seele's nose, they were destroyed by her breath—countless steel beasts exploding near her nostrils. As for the navy, they had already been churned into pieces alongside the fleet when White Seele dipped her feet into the ocean. \\n\\n\"So, how's my service?\" Gently kneading White Seele's chest, Black Seele's other hand reached mischievously toward White Seele's nether regions. By the time White Seele realized, her skirt had been lifted, and even her panties were about to be pulled aside. \\n\\n\"Don't!\" With a blushing face, White Seele shook her head, trying to block Black Seele's hand, but it was useless. Black Seele just swatted her away, and White Seele could only obediently move her hands, allowing Black Seele's fingers
-    to enter. \\n\\nThe moment she touched White Seele's honeyed aperture, White Seele suddenly trembled. This was a massive disaster for the little people below; intense earthquakes instantly tore the earth apart, and countless people fell into the deep fissures. Subsequent tremors turned the area below completely into a dead zone. \\n\\n\"Watch closely, bugs—this might be the last time you get to admire a girl's private parts~\" Black Seele toyed with the bugs below while her fingers continued to churn within White Seele's aperture. White Seele's suppressed moans gradually turned into rhythmic cries. The sound waves emitted from her 100,000-times enlarged body caused the little people nearby to burst into clouds of blood mist instantly. Even those far from Seele couldn't avoid having their eardrums punctured by the sound, blood flowing continuously. \\n\\n\"Yes, just like that.\" Black Seele's movements grew faster, her thrusts more forceful. White Seele's love juices had already formed a lake higher than the ground below, the flowing liquid drowning everything beneath it. Survivors and their cities were submerged and destroyed by the viscous love juices, which then flowed into the ocean. \\n\\n\"Ah!!!\" A cry of pleasure that surpassed all sounds in the universe echoed through the entire planet. White Seele's love juices surged out from her aperture; her white panties caught most of it, but some liquid still flowed along the continents into the sea, turning the coastline into an ocean of love juices. \\n\\n\"Mmm~ Salty.\" Black Seele lightly put her fingers soaked in love juices into her mouth to taste, then casually wiped them on a nearby city. Beside her, White Seele was already full of blushes. Perhaps after the girl finished her rest, this planet would not escape her clutches..."
+  #  \"唔...另一个我，你又带我到什么地方来了。\"看着底下蓝绿相间的地块，白希有些不知所措，这样的场景只有她与黑希在星海遨游时见过，但那些小小的星球根本不可能让她们有机会降临在上面。\n\"这可是我专门为你准备的礼物～\"带着坏笑的黑希向着白希走去，本应坚固的地面却被二十万倍的黑希踩出一个又一个足型坑洞，对于星球的小人们来说，这样的坑洞是巨大的灾难，不仅仅是其中溢出的岩浆，还有那被数百万吨的重量压实的泥土，但他们很快就不需要考虑这些了...\n\"另一个我！\"\n白希的话音还未落下，黑希的玉足就已经落在了地上，而脚印两边赫然分布着一座巨型城市，作为沿海的商业港口，大量的人口居住在其中，灾难来临时，他们早已聚集在地下的防空洞内，祈求着脆弱的工事能挡住黑希的毁灭，但黑希根本不会给他们机会，她早就看到了人们在哪里，并且精准的踩中了人口最多的数十个防空洞，上千万人被神明的力量所踩中，这裹挟着头顶泥土的力量瞬间将他们掩埋，尸体与血液在泥土中爆开，而没有躲进防空洞内的人们，要么在楼房内被碎裂的建筑所覆盖，要么\"幸运\"地与黑希的脚掌来了个亲密接触，但无一例外，他们都被希儿碾成肉泥。\n\"你...\"\n白希从未如此近距离看过这恐怖的一幕，即使曾经对星球的毁灭也仅仅是弹指一瞬，然而对微生物们的屠杀还在继续，似乎是为了让白希再看一次一般，黑希的脚向左右扫动，虽不如落脚的深度，但这样的破坏依然摧毁了小人们幸存的城市，而看着这一切的白希脑子一片空白，她仿佛能听到城市里人们的哀嚎与求饶，不过黑希此时已经来到了她的面前。\n\"怎么啦，你还对这些虫子抱有怜悯吗？\"坐下来的黑希无意间又压扁了一座城市，不过这对于城市里的百万人来说或许是件好事，如果他们看到了黑希接下来的行为，他们甚至会感谢黑希赐予了他们瞬间死亡。\"没...没有。\"不太想扰乱黑希兴致的白希只能违心地回答，但接下来黑希却环抱着她，慢慢躺了下来。\n\"这颗星球很适合做我们的游乐场呢，恒星的光芒与温度刚好合适，地面也挺软的，还有这么多小虫子陪我们一起～\"带着坏笑的黑希将脑袋轻轻放上白希的肩膀，享受着另一个自己身上 maiden的芬芳，而不断轰炸着她们的空军与轨道舰队则被随手扇毁，或是被黑希轻轻捏住，按碎在白希的身体上。\n\"你看，即使你什么都不做，这些小虫子们也会被你的一举一动给杀死呢。\"黑希笑着揉了揉白希的鼻子，就在刚刚，星球上的军队出动了所有的空军，但刚飞过白希的鼻子时就被呼吸所破坏，无数的钢铁巨兽炸开在白希的鼻孔旁，而海军，则早在白希将脚放入海洋中时，就与黑希的玉足一起将舰队搅碎了。\n\"怎么样，我的服务还不错吧～\"轻轻揉捏着白希的胸口，黑希的另一只手不老实的向白希身下伸去，而当白皙反应过来时，裙子已经被掀开，甚至胖次都要被扒开。\n\"别！\"脸羞红的白希摇了摇头，试图挡住黑希的手，但并没有什么效果，黑希只是随手一拍，白希也只能乖乖将手移开，任由黑希的手指伸进去。\n触碰到白希蜜穴的一瞬间，白希突然颤抖了一下，这对身下撤离的小人们来说可是不小的灾难，强烈的地震瞬间撕裂了大地，无数的小人掉进了那幽深的裂痕中，而接下来，一次又一次的震动将他们的下面完全变成了无人区。\n\"好好看着，虫子们，这说不定是你们最后一次欣赏 maiden的私处了呢～\"黑希一边挑弄这身下的虫子，一边双指继续在白希的蜜穴当中搅动，而白希从原本压抑的轻哼，逐渐变为一段一段的叫声，从十万倍躯体内发出的音波让近处的小人们瞬间炸开成一团团血雾，而即使是离希儿很远的，也无可避免的被这声音击穿了耳膜，不断流出鲜血。\n\"对，就是这样。\"黑希手上动作越发快速，抽查的力气也越来越大，白希的爱液造就在下面形成了一片高于地表的湖泊，流动的液体同样淹没着身下的一切，幸存者连同着他们的城市一起被粘稠的爱液淹没，破坏，并流入了海洋之中。\n\"啊！！！\"一声超越宇宙中一切声音的浪叫传遍了整颗星球，白希的爱液从蜜穴中瞬间冲出，白色的胖次拦下了大多数的液体，但仍有一部分液体顺着大陆流进海里，让海岸线变成了一片爱液的海洋。\n\"嗯～咸咸的。\"黑希将沾满爱液的手指轻轻伸进嘴里品尝后，随手抹在了一旁的城市上，而身旁的白希早已满脸羞红，或许在 maiden休息过后，这颗星球也难逃毒手吧...
+  gts_seele.226.desc: "\"Mmm... my other self, where have you taken me this time?\" Looking at the blue and green tiles below, White Seele was at a loss; she and Black Seele had only seen such scenes while traveling through the sea of stars, but those tiny planets could never provide them an opportunity to descend upon them. \n\n\"This is a gift I specially prepared for you~\" With a wicked smile, Black Seele walked toward White Seele. The supposedly solid ground was stomped into one foot-shaped crater after another by the 200,000-times enlarged Black Seele. For the little people on the planet, these craters were massive disasters - not only for the overflowing lava but also for the soil compacted by millions of tons of weight. But they soon wouldn't need to worry about that... \n\n\"My other self!\" \n\nBefore White Seele could finish her sentence, Black Seele's jade feet had already landed on the ground. Flanking the footprint was a giant city; as a coastal commercial port, it housed a large population. When the disaster struck, they had already gathered in underground air-raid shelters, praying that the fragile works could block Black Seele's destruction. But Black Seele wouldn't give them a chance; she had long seen where the people were and precisely stomped on dozens of the most populated shelters. Tens of millions were crushed by the divine power, the force compacting the soil above and burying them instantly - bodies and blood exploding within the earth. Those who hadn't reached shelters were either covered by collapsing buildings or 'lucky' enough to have a close encounter with Black Seele's sole. Without exception, Seele ground them into meat paste. \n\n\"You...\" \n\nWhite Seele had never seen such a terrifying scene so closely, even though destroying a planet once took only a flick of a finger. Yet the slaughter of microorganisms continued; as if to let White Seele see it again, Black Seele's feet swept left and right. Though not as deep as the initial stomp, this destruction still leveled the little people's surviving cities. White Seele's mind went blank as she watched, seemingly hearing the wails and pleas for mercy from the cities. But Black Seele had now come before her. \n\n\"What's wrong? Do you still have pity for these bugs?\" Sitting down, Black Seele inadvertently flattened another city. Though for the millions in that city, perhaps it was a mercy; if they saw Black Seele's next actions, they might even thank her for granting them an instant death. \"N-no.\" Not wanting to ruin Black Seele's mood, White Seele could only answer against her conscience. But then Black Seele embraced her and slowly lay down. \n\n\"This planet is perfect as our playground. The star's light and temperature are just right, the ground is soft, and there are so many little bugs to keep us company~\" With a smirk, Black Seele gently rested her head on White Seele's shoulder, enjoying the girl's fragrance from her other self. The air forces and orbital fleets continuously bombing them were swatted away or caught by Black Seele and crushed against White Seele's body. \n\n\"See? Even if you do nothing, these little bugs will be killed by your every movement.\" Black Seele smiled and rubbed White Seele's nose. Just then, the planet's military deployed all its air forces, but as they flew past White Seele's nose, they were destroyed by her breath - countless steel beasts exploding near her nostrils. As for the navy, they had already been churned into pieces alongside the fleet when White Seele dipped her feet into the ocean. \n\n\"So, how's my service?\" Gently kneading White Seele's chest, Black Seele's other hand reached mischievously toward White Seele's nether regions. By the time White Seele realized, her skirt had been lifted, and even her panties were about to be pulled aside. \n\n\"Don't!\" With a blushing face, White Seele shook her head, trying to block Black Seele's hand, but it was useless. Black Seele just swatted her away, and White Seele could only obediently move her hands, allowing Black Seele's fingers
+    to enter. \n\nThe moment she touched White Seele's honeyed aperture, White Seele suddenly trembled. This was a massive disaster for the little people below; intense earthquakes instantly tore the earth apart, and countless people fell into the deep fissures. Subsequent tremors turned the area below completely into a dead zone. \n\n\"Watch closely, bugs - this might be the last time you get to admire a girl's private parts~\" Black Seele toyed with the bugs below while her fingers continued to churn within White Seele's aperture. White Seele's suppressed moans gradually turned into rhythmic cries. The sound waves emitted from her 100,000-times enlarged body caused the little people nearby to burst into clouds of blood mist instantly. Even those far from Seele couldn't avoid having their eardrums punctured by the sound, blood flowing continuously. \n\n\"Yes, just like that.\" Black Seele's movements grew faster, her thrusts more forceful. White Seele's love juices had already formed a lake higher than the ground below, the flowing liquid drowning everything beneath it. Survivors and their cities were submerged and destroyed by the viscous love juices, which then flowed into the ocean. \n\n\"Ah!!!\" A cry of pleasure that surpassed all sounds in the universe echoed through the entire planet. White Seele's love juices surged out from her aperture; her white panties caught most of it, but some liquid still flowed along the continents into the sea, turning the coastline into an ocean of love juices. \n\n\"Mmm~ Salty.\" Black Seele lightly put her fingers soaked in love juices into her mouth to taste, then casually wiped them on a nearby city. Beside her, White Seele was already full of blushes. Perhaps after the girl finished her rest, this planet would not escape her clutches..."
   #  §B"你好,请问现在有空吗?希儿有份小礼物想要给你."§!\n听到熟悉的声音,抬头向天空看去,想象中的面庞或是湛蓝眼眸并未出现,仍是一片晴朗的蓝天.四周也没有见到希儿的踪影,疑惑时又一道声音从耳边响起.\n§B"是崩坏能啦,或者说灵能?总之用来交流的话,会方便不少呢.如果可以的话,就请您先闭上眼睛,剩下的就让希儿来解决吧"§!\n出于信任,你缓缓闭上了眼睛.如果她真的想要做些什么,也不用如此麻烦吧...世界仿佛变得万分宁静,与想象中毁灭的轰隆声截然相反.而你再次"听"到的声音则是希儿轻声的提醒.\n§B"好啦,现在可以睁眼了,"§!明明在进入前还在帝国首府之中,此刻周围环境却像是隐藏在一片朦胧,依稀可以辨别出自己站在一张鎏金色的桌子上,目光可及之处只有一柄歪扭的天平,以及希儿期待的眼神.§B"这里就是圣痕空间,根据大家研究的现有理论成果..大概是物质与精神交接的地方吧.不要担心,这里很安全的"§!\n"那么礼物是?"\n希儿早有准备地从不知道什么地方端出了一碗..汤?"就是甜菜汤哦,以前在孤儿院的时候,姐姐就会给希儿做这个.希儿也想要给您分享下这份回忆."汤匙在冒着热气的红汤中缓缓搅拌,除了甜菜的味道,空气中还弥漫着淡淡的酸奶油的味道.这些过于熟悉的味道让你感到一丝陌生,似乎它们不应该出现在这里§B"唔,材料吗?是希儿去其他世界泡里寻找的,虽然可能不完全一样,但味道一定不会差的,希儿自己都尝过了!现在快点趁热尝尝吧"§!\n有些略大的汤匙缓缓伸到你的面前,温度适宜的汤中漂浮着切地十分细小的甜菜与牛肉块,品尝起来让人感到十分舒适.不知而喻间小碗一般的汤匙已经见底,希儿刚刚拿出些干面包,你身上的通讯器便不合时宜地响了起来...\n§B"您还有事情要忙吗?那希儿先不打扰了,等您有空的时候再来陪陪希儿就好"§!放下通讯器,似乎今天的会面必须暂告终止,§B"那这碗汤就让希儿送到您的办公室吧,至于办法..您就不用操心了."\n睁开眼时,你再次回到了熟悉的办公室,而舌尖上隐盈的回味让你确信刚刚的经历并非幻觉,然而看着堆积的公文,只能祈祷国务卿快些来帮忙......§!\n\n\n终于处理完事务,颓废地趴在桌子上,身边整理着文件的国务卿不禁投来幽怨的眼神."好饿哇,要是有什么吃的就好了..."然而一片文件中,一碗甜菜汤突兀地放在那里..."这是什么时候放在这里的?"\n面对询问,国务卿也有些疑惑,"似乎是突然出现的?看起来味道不错?但还是先检..."\n虽然不知道希儿到底是怎么把甜菜汤放到你的桌子上的,但你还是义无反顾地喝了一大口.再次品味到熟悉的味道,有些含糊不清地向国务卿询问"办公室里有没有干面包?以及你刚才说什么?"\n"没有这种东西...办公室当然是办公的...你是不是在变小??!"无奈地吐槽着你的话语,但紧接着发生的变化让她顾不上评价,几乎是立即宣布警戒并联系了医疗人员.\n"唔?!"注意到视线变化,你险些没在椅子上坐稳摔倒,随着体型缩小了十倍多,你决定先爬到桌子上以免卡在椅子的缝隙中,而随着缩小逐渐加快,曾经的桌子仿佛变成了宽大的平原.迫于无奈你只得先跳到国务卿的手掌中以躲避潜在的危害.\n随着救援到来,她们终于在手掌上找到了极度微小的你,此刻体型已经缩小了大概千万倍而且还在快速缩小...\n\n\n经过检测,那碗突然出现的甜菜汤里存在致死量的缩小激素,比起你的安危,还让她们关心的便是如何将如此浓度的药剂溶解到一碗汤中...\n在尝试了许多方法恢复体型无果后,最终还是希儿帮助你回到了原本的大小.,而这样做的原因便是为了将甜菜汤以合适的大小送到桌前,希儿便向里添加了巨量的缩小激素,自己品尝味道没有变化后,才在工作完成时将其送了过来,至于那碗喝了大概会缩小到虚无的甜菜汤,我们还是将其保留在了博物天枢中
-  gts_seele.301.desc: "§B\"Hello, do you have a moment? Seele has a small gift for you.\"§! \\n\\nHearing the familiar voice, you looked up at the sky. The expected face or azure eyes didn't appear; it was still a clear blue sky. No sign of Seele was around. While puzzled, another voice sounded by your ear. \\n\\n§B\"It's Houkai energy—or should I say psionics? Anyway, it's quite convenient for communication. If you're willing, please close your eyes first and let Seele handle the rest.\"§! \\n\\nOut of trust, you slowly closed your eyes. If she really wanted to do something, she wouldn't need to go through such trouble... The world seemed to become incredibly peaceful, quite the opposite of the booming sounds of destruction you imagined. The voice you \"heard\" again was Seele's soft reminder. \\n\\n§B\"Alright, you can open your eyes now.\"§! \\n\\nThough you were in the imperial capital before entering, the surrounding environment now seemed hidden in a mist. You could vaguely discern yourself standing on a gilded table. Within sight were only a skewed balance scale and Seele's expectant eyes. §B\"This is the Stigma Space. According to existing theoretical results... it's roughly where matter and spirit meet. Don't worry, it's very safe here.\"§! \\n\\n\"So, the gift?\" \\n\\nSeele had long been prepared, bringing out a bowl of... soup from somewhere. \"It's Beetroot Soup. Back at the orphanage, Big Sister would make this for Seele. Seele wanted to share this memory with you.\" The spoon slowly stirred the steaming red soup. Besides the scent of beetroot, there was a faint aroma of sour cream. These overly familiar smells felt a bit alien, as if they shouldn't belong here. §B\"Mmm, the ingredients? Seele searched for them in other world bubbles. Though they might not be exactly the same, the taste definitely won't be bad. Seele tasted it herself! Now, try it while it's hot.\"§! \\n\\nA slightly large spoon was slowly presented before you. In the appropriately tempered soup floated finely chopped beetroot and beef chunks, making the tasting experience very comfortable. Before you knew it, the bowl-like spoon was empty. Just as Seele brought out some dry bread, your communicator rang at an inopportune time... \\n\\n§B\"Do you still have matters to attend to? Seele won't disturb you then. Just come and keep Seele company when you're free.\"§! \\n\\nYou put down the communicator; it seemed today's meeting had to end tentatively. §B\"Then Seele will send this bowl of soup to your office. As for how... you don't need to worry.\"§! \\n\\nOpening your eyes, you were back in your familiar office. The lingering aftertaste on your tongue confirmed the experience wasn't a hallucination. However, looking at the piled documents, you could only pray the Secretary of State would come to help soon... \\n\\n\\nFinally finishing your work, you lay slumped on the desk. The Secretary of State, who was organizing files nearby, couldn't help but cast a resentful glance. \"I'm so hungry... if only there was something to eat...\" Yet, among the papers, a bowl of beetroot soup sat there abruptly... \"When was this placed here?\" \\n\\nIn response to your query, the Secretary was also puzzled. \"It seemed to appear out of nowhere. Looks tasty? But let's check it first...\" \\n\\nThough you didn't know how Seele got the soup onto your desk, you resolutely took a large gulp. Tasting the familiar flavor again, you asked the Secretary indistinctly, \"Is there any dry bread in the office? And what did you just say?\" \\n\\n\"There's no such thing... the office is for work... Wait, ARE YOU SHRINKING??!\" She was about to complain, but the sudden change made her forget her words. She immediately declared an alert and contacted medical personnel. \\n\\n\"Whoa?!\" Noticing the change in perspective, you nearly fell off your chair. As your size decreased more than tenfold, you decided to climb onto the desk to avoid getting stuck in the chair's gaps. As the shrinking accelerated, the desk became like a vast plain. Forced by circumstances, you had to jump into
-    the Secretary's palm to avoid potential hazards. \\n\\nWhen the rescue arrived, they finally found the extremely tiny you in her palm. By now, your size had shrunk millions of times and was still rapidly decreasing... \\n\\n\\nUpon testing, the abruptly appeared beetroot soup contained a lethal dose of Shrinking Hormone. Beyond your safety, they were also concerned about how such a high concentration of the drug was dissolved into a bowl of soup... \\n\\nAfter trying many methods to restore your size without success, Seele finally helped you return to your original scale. The reason for all this was that to deliver the beetroot soup in a size appropriate for the desk, Seele had added a massive amount of Shrinking Hormone. After tasting it and finding no change in flavor, she delivered it once her work was done. As for the bowl of beetroot soup that would likely shrink one into nonexistence if drunk, we have preserved it in the Celestial Museum."
+  gts_seele.301.desc: "§B\"Hello, do you have a moment? Seele has a small gift for you.\"§! \n\nHearing the familiar voice, you looked up at the sky. The expected face or azure eyes didn't appear; it was still a clear blue sky. No sign of Seele was around. While puzzled, another voice sounded by your ear. \n\n§B\"It's Houkai energy - or should I say psionics? Anyway, it's quite convenient for communication. If you're willing, please close your eyes first and let Seele handle the rest.\"§! \n\nOut of trust, you slowly closed your eyes. If she really wanted to do something, she wouldn't need to go through such trouble... The world seemed to become incredibly peaceful, quite the opposite of the booming sounds of destruction you imagined. The voice you \"heard\" again was Seele's soft reminder. \n\n§B\"Alright, you can open your eyes now.\"§! \n\nThough you were in the imperial capital before entering, the surrounding environment now seemed hidden in a mist. You could vaguely discern yourself standing on a gilded table. Within sight were only a skewed balance scale and Seele's expectant eyes. §B\"This is the Stigma Space. According to existing theoretical results... it's roughly where matter and spirit meet. Don't worry, it's very safe here.\"§! \n\n\"So, the gift?\" \n\nSeele had long been prepared, bringing out a bowl of... soup from somewhere. \"It's Beetroot Soup. Back at the orphanage, Big Sister would make this for Seele. Seele wanted to share this memory with you.\" The spoon slowly stirred the steaming red soup. Besides the scent of beetroot, there was a faint aroma of sour cream. These overly familiar smells felt a bit alien, as if they shouldn't belong here. §B\"Mmm, the ingredients? Seele searched for them in other world bubbles. Though they might not be exactly the same, the taste definitely won't be bad. Seele tasted it herself! Now, try it while it's hot.\"§! \n\nA slightly large spoon was slowly presented before you. In the appropriately tempered soup floated finely chopped beetroot and beef chunks, making the tasting experience very comfortable. Before you knew it, the bowl-like spoon was empty. Just as Seele brought out some dry bread, your communicator rang at an inopportune time... \n\n§B\"Do you still have matters to attend to? Seele won't disturb you then. Just come and keep Seele company when you're free.\"§! \n\nYou put down the communicator; it seemed today's meeting had to end tentatively. §B\"Then Seele will send this bowl of soup to your office. As for how... you don't need to worry.\"§! \n\nOpening your eyes, you were back in your familiar office. The lingering aftertaste on your tongue confirmed the experience wasn't a hallucination. However, looking at the piled documents, you could only pray the Secretary of State would come to help soon... \n\n\nFinally finishing your work, you lay slumped on the desk. The Secretary of State, who was organizing files nearby, couldn't help but cast a resentful glance. \"I'm so hungry... if only there was something to eat...\" Yet, among the papers, a bowl of beetroot soup sat there abruptly... \"When was this placed here?\" \n\nIn response to your query, the Secretary was also puzzled. \"It seemed to appear out of nowhere. Looks tasty? But let's check it first...\" \n\nThough you didn't know how Seele got the soup onto your desk, you resolutely took a large gulp. Tasting the familiar flavor again, you asked the Secretary indistinctly, \"Is there any dry bread in the office? And what did you just say?\" \n\n\"There's no such thing... the office is for work... Wait, ARE YOU SHRINKING??!\" She was about to complain, but the sudden change made her forget her words. She immediately declared an alert and contacted medical personnel. \n\n\"Whoa?!\" Noticing the change in perspective, you nearly fell off your chair. As your size decreased more than tenfold, you decided to climb onto the desk to avoid getting stuck in the chair's gaps. As the shrinking accelerated, the desk became like a vast plain. Forced by circumstances, you had to jump into
+    the Secretary's palm to avoid potential hazards. \n\nWhen the rescue arrived, they finally found the extremely tiny you in her palm. By now, your size had shrunk millions of times and was still rapidly decreasing... \n\n\nUpon testing, the abruptly appeared beetroot soup contained a lethal dose of Shrinking Hormone. Beyond your safety, they were also concerned about how such a high concentration of the drug was dissolved into a bowl of soup... \n\nAfter trying many methods to restore your size without success, Seele finally helped you return to your original scale. The reason for all this was that to deliver the beetroot soup in a size appropriate for the desk, Seele had added a massive amount of Shrinking Hormone. After tasting it and finding no change in flavor, she delivered it once her work was done. As for the bowl of beetroot soup that would likely shrink one into nonexistence if drunk, we have preserved it in the Celestial Museum."
