y. Once prosperous structures offered little resistance under the meat wall of the girl's foot, crushed into dust the instant they made contact with her skin. Only a few lucky buildings were fortunate enough to be spared Skadi's wrath. Snagged in the wrinkles beneath her foot, they escaped being turned into a pile of rubble. Then, scarcely a fraction of a second later, Skadi's sole had completely made contact with the fragmented earth. The gap between her foot and the ground disappeared under the girl's weight. This city district, as we planned, had become dust under Skadi's foot. However, despite the desperate scenes within the city, Skadi felt not even a sliver of stimulation from the moment she lifted her foot to the moment she crushed it entirely.\n\n§BFinished? Oh well. I was planning to destroy this planet once the shrinking hormones’ effect wore off...§!\n\nAlthough Skadi’s last words caused the other inhabitants of this planet to feel apprehensive, we still successfully found what we needed in the continent-sized footprint Skadi left behind."
