   gts_suxiaobai.900.desc: "With the development of the empire, many economically prosperous planets have emerged. However, recently, mysterious events have occurred within the empire's borders. Planets in certain sectors suddenly lose contact with the capital. When the fleet arrives, all that remains are lifeless dead stars and bodily fluids left by a giantess.\n\nA colony planet is happily spending a peaceful Sunday. Crowds of people splashing in the water can be seen everywhere along the riverbank. Friends chat leisurely about family matters between city buildings. Cars pass by bustling crowds on the streets. Everyone is accustomed to this slow-paced, happy life.\n\n\"Boom!\"\nSuddenly, a sudden earthquake accompanied by thunderous noise spreads throughout the planet. People look up and see ruins pierced by countless silver-white columns pointing vertically to the ground. The noise just now was the loud sound of these columns pressing against the ground.\n\nEven more terrifying is that these silver-white columns landed over the city. Strangely, although whole patches of high-rise buildings were pressed underneath, only slight damage occurred.\n\nFrom a distance, it is impossible to know what these columns are, but people observing up close recognize what these incredibly soft columns actually are.\n\nThe surroundings suddenly darken. People on the planet look up at the sky. In deep space, so distant that even clouds have disappeared, a terrifying scene appears. A face that blends into the background replaces the original sky. It is a girl's face. Her snow-white skin occasionally reveals a rosy glow under the starlight. Clouds flow under the girl's face, setting off the whiteness of her skin. Long eyelashes decorate a pair of crimson pupils. Hot breath occasionally escapes from two tender thin lips. The girl's breath pours down onto the planet from above. The air people are breathing is filled with a peculiar scent.\n\nAs for the columns pressing on the city, they