ore further, the universe on the other side suddenly began to repel the two Traptrix leaders. The huge pressure around them attacked the research ship, easily destroying the shipborne shields and the hull. Just when Sera and Allomerus were desperate, they suddenly found themselves back in the Terminus black hole, and... the black hole gravity and mass did not seem to have any effect on them. Because they were affected by the giant goddess on the other side of the world, If they only touched her jade feet for a moment, they had the ability to obtain energy from the black hole and the other end of the Terminus black hole, and the Terminus black hole obviously cannot support the reverse energy transportation from the other end for a long time, so naturally, in their actions Gradually depleted, eventually became history.\n\nAs for their situation\n\n'Uwa... If you don't have enough energy to replenish after absorbing the energy over there for a long time, you will naturally be hungry. Our current state should be able to help you solve a lot of enemies. We feel that we can easily capture and eat the planets of those bad guys! But correspondingly, the reward can't be less for us  -  oh, and our tribe!'"
 
