   gts_xinuo.15.desc: "Dawn was breaking. Remnant defenders who had fought for days to repel enemy attacks were just about to close their eyes when increasing vibration and noise woke them up like an alarm clock. Fearing enemy arrival, defenders rushed back to battle posts.\n\nWalking out of houses with weapons, surprised not to be blinded by sunlight, puzzled guards turned their wrists. Their old partner on the wrist told them it was already 7 AM, but the block under their feet seemed abandoned by sunlight, stealing a sliver of light from adjacent blocks. Detecting anomalies, a bad guess appeared in everyone's heart. With inner unease, while activating global satellites to probe the environment, soldiers followed the panicked crowd and speeding vehicles to deduce the disaster's direction, slowly scanning houses and streets, until seeing that large abruptly blue wall in the suburb. Looking up, they realized it was a giant high heel, and looking up sharply, they met the eyes of that huge existence.\n\nImages from sky monitors allowed defenders to better see the whole picture. A blue-haired dragon girl squatted outside the city, her cast shadow covering half the city. A skirt bright as moonlight replaced the azure canvas, outlining snowy white legs as splendid as sunlight in the starry sky formed by the skirt. Just right meatiness and good proportions, possessing both child-like cuteness and mature woman's sexiness. If one had the chance to touch, feel the slightly lower body temperature and tender feeling, one would be obsessed with the softness slightly collapsing with kneading.\n\nThe slender dragon tail leaking from behind looked crystal clear like a bright gem, adding a bit of non-human mystery. Holding her naturally beautiful face with slender and long fingers, she coldly examined every tired defender below with golden dragon pupils. Defenders identified this likely as the enemy leader Xinuo.\n\nDefenders were already scared weak in the legs by the huge object in front, also an evil god exceeding human power. Stumbling a few times, they knelt on the ground with a thud. Weak hands tried several times to retrieve dropped guns. Survivors at the time recalled, in that half hour, even if officers kept building them up psychologically, inner fear made their bodies tremble uncontrollably, finally only able to tremble holding weapons for so-called resistance.\n\nThis silence was broken by Xinuo first. \"If you surrender now, I won't touch everyone. We can still coexist peacefully.\" Xinuo smiled at the ground army, her tail wagging slightly behind, showing a harmless look to intimidate.\n\n§B\"Resistance is futile, you know\"§!\n\nHearing Xinuo's words, a veteran from the front line went weak in the legs and fell to the ground. Nearby recruits hurried forward to help. Before the recruit could comfort him, the emotionally overwhelmed veteran grabbed the recruit's wrist tightly, almost crying as he recounted his experience.\n\nThe maiden's slender finger fell casually. Even without extra force, to soldiers under the finger, it was like a mountain falling from the sky. Under this heavy pressure, their exoskeleton armor screamed in agony after lasting seconds. Guards watched helplessly as armor embedded into flesh, only watching their arms and legs snap like branches under pressure. Bone cracking sounds rang like firecrackers. Bloody marrow crawled out of bodies like maggots. Human bodies losing support folded from the waist and passed out directly. As the finger pad pressed down slowly, soldiers who let go early wanting to live were trapped in a cage made of companions' corpses, finally heading to the same ending as companions under heavy pressure. Her fingernails were covered with bone fragments and iron filings. When the finger lifted again, only sticky threads of flesh mixture linked to the ground like spider webs.\n\nSurrounding soldiers seeing from the corner of their eyes couldn't control vomiting. Most importantly, when they looked at the maiden causing all this, they found only faint pride and disgust for small folk flesh
     on her face.\n\nTo wipe the flesh off her hand, Xinuo poked her finger into the ground, lifting the road like a bulldozer, cutting off the small folk and buildings ahead from the waist, crushing them all under her finger. In the end, the veteran crawled to save people but could only stare at the deep pit smeared with flesh, not knowing why he had to suffer such pain. Crushed like a bug for fighting for freedom.\n\nJust listening to the veteran's description, everyone's mind overflowed with fear. Unable to bear the pressure, they fired the first shot bringing death in despair. Losing large-caliber weapons, the attack was just lighting a few fireworks on the maiden's skin. Bullets hitting the skin collapsed into a ball due to acceleration and fell from the still smooth skin. The defenders' attack was completely pathetic useless effort."
