   gts_xinuo.19.desc: "Starlight shone on this planet for hundreds of millions of years. But today people in the Eastern Hemisphere didn't wait for that warm sunlight as usual. Instead deep darkness covered the sky canopy. Restless people tried to uncover this mysterious veil, but news seemed completely blocked, no reliable news flowed out.\n\n§B\"Hmm... looks good.\"§!\n\nXinuo descending here seemed completely unaware of how much impact she caused to people on the planet. Tens of thousands of meters long tongue tip gently swept across rosy lips. Faint scent invaded planet atmosphere. Scent amplified millions of times intoxicated people on planet. Suddenly transmitted satellite image played Xinuo's figure in loop on people's devices. Countless people worshiped the sky, believing this was sign of goddess saving the world. Even if broadcast already issued evacuation signal, city still densely distributed hundreds of millions of humans feverishly calling goddess. And fleeing stream trapped by crowded streets, helplessly watching that huge red monster falling towards planet.\n\n\"Bang!\" As tongue tip fell heavily, strong impact disturbed planet airflow. Hurricane swept entire planet centering tongue tip. All aircraft shot down by terrifying airflow. And tongue tip location pressed into deep pit. 300,000 corpses and city debris filled by saliva flowing down. While Xinuo far in space just closed eyes feeling life energy inflow.\n\nPink monster stopped. At least small folk on ground thought so. Small folk praying for boundless tongue tip to leave ignited will to survive. And army attacks producing little explosions let people on ground see hope again. But, with a ballistic missile attack, Xinuo trembled suddenly, driving tongue tip to crush a whole surrounding city. Unexpected attack crushed millions in city into pieces. And from satellite image, this goddess frowned slightly, seemingly very dissatisfied with accident just now.\n\n§B\"Well, didn't want to end so fast.\"§!\n\nDeafening divine voice came from above sky canopy again. Xinuo touched earth with tongue tip again. And this time, she didn't wait, just gently licked across planet. And that widest continent, after being swept by tongue tip, left only brown soil covered by saliva. Surviving army tried to block natural disaster. But absolute power isn't balanced by sparse courage. They could only shoot helplessly, hitting small sparks on tongue surface, then becoming Xinuo's nutrient along with land under feet.\n\n§B\"Mmm~\"§!\n\nLooking at art she left on planet surface, Xinuo nodded satisfied. At least now she is satisfied. Although nearly half of planet landmarks, [owner.gts_event_kills_logs] small folk and [owner.gts_event_city_kills_logs] cities have been licked clean by Xinuo. But these small folk really should thank her. Like before, this planet would have been eaten by her long ago. Eating only half is already very restrained. Satisfied touching her belly, Xinuo disappeared in galaxy instantly, leaving only helpless small folk to rebuild homes on this hellish earth."
