   gts_xinuo.302.desc: "§H\"Warning! Warning! Abnormal energy fluctuation detected!\"§!\n\nAfter cracking the shackles inside Xinuo's body, alarms suddenly blared in the institute. A blue light ball formed inside Xinuo's cryo pod. Terrible high temperature completely burned the cryo pod, but the maiden's body was wrapped intact inside. Active blue energy constantly flowed into the maiden's body. Her size expanded at speed visible to naked eye. Solid outer wall was smashed a big hole by maiden's body. But maiden didn't stop growing, instead crushing several adjacent blocks amidst gasps.\n\n§B\"Hmph... ah, woah!!!\"§!\n\nXinuo, whose size had expanded to a thousand times, hurriedly stopped her energy absorption. But at this time over 50,000 people had been turned into meat mud by her body, sleeping forever in soil. If she hadn't stopped growing, perhaps more areas would have suffered.\n\nBut even more incredible thing appeared. That faint blue light appeared in Xinuo's dimming bloodline again, injected underground along body. Whole city was wrapped by a wonderful magic circle, imprinted on earth like constellations in sky. Blurred flesh and collapsed buildings were re-aggregated and shaped by this magical power, returning to original state.\n\n§B\"That's great...\"§!\n\nIt seems Xinuo breathed a sigh of relief. Then, energy flowing on earth returned to Xinuo's body at flying speed.\n\n§B\"That...\"§!\n\nLooking at experimental building destroyed by herself, Xinuo extended legs from gap, gently patted stains sticking to legs, re-guiding energy, seemingly slowly familiarizing with her power.\n\nReshaped experimental building was covered with a protective shell, seemingly sturdier than before. Researchers and civilians injured in accident were also issued corresponding compensation. As for Xinuo, we have sent her to space shipyard. Now she is waiting for your order. Also, thanks to her skilled control of internal power, she can return to small size at any time. Choice lies with you, Leader."
