   gts_xinuo.106.desc.tiny: "After final progress completed, liquid in cultivation pod was pumped out. Glass door opened slowly. Maiden lying inside appeared naked in front of us. Team members watched maiden in pod vigilantly. Then, two jade arms rested on outer wall, fair body sat up slowly. Curvaceous body and waist-length long hair affected team members' psychology.\n\nConfused maiden scanned surrounding environment. Science officer stepped out from crowd, trying to communicate with maiden.\n\n§B\"Has my country... disappeared?\"§!\n\nMaiden looked at science officer's attire, asked faintly. [Root.leader.GetName] just nodded. We don't know what impact such answer has on her. But maiden's eyes just dimmed a bit, sighed lightly and shook head.\n\n§B\"According to manufacturing requirements, I will transfer allegiance object. Hope my ability can be useful in future.\"§!\n\nRed lips parted slightly, ethereal voice floated in closed space. Voice still carried a trace of sadness, but raised face was full of determination again."
