ll or the pressure from the shoe opening, countless crew members knelt and bowed before Little Grey begging for her leniency , but Little Grey's smile did not diminish. Instead, she looked at the gradually collapsing fleet with greater playfulness. \n\n'Why don't you help me with something? If you do, I'll let you leave.'\n\nThis undoubtedly gave the collapsing crew a glimmer of hope. They weren't worried about whether Little Grey would break her promise. Just to give themselves a little bit of hope for survival, the commander did not even ask what it was and hurriedly agreed. \n\n'Very proactive. What you'll have to do is clean my foot filth for me. You should be able to accomplish that, right~?'\n\nThe ‘black hole’ rapidly moved towards them, from pure darkness they came to another space of darkness, and the strong foot odor had almost taken a physical form , the lingering foot sweat repeatedly washed over the ships like a tide. This all impacted the crew, further reducing their already small amount of remaining sanity . Once the 'capture' was complete, the fleet had been sent to the bottom of Little Grey's boots. And after being herded into the boot, it was only then that they felt just how difficult the task was -- the foot filth that piled up on the bottom of her shoe was as big as a continents and no matter how high the quality of weapons was, it was unable to move it in the slightest. \n\n'Seems like you're not willing to help, right? Do you want me to help you?'\n\nWithout giving her 'helpers' a choice, Little Grey put her white silk feet back into the boots. Her immaculate silk-encased feet enveloped all the ships and pushed them into the foot filth at the bottom of the boot. But the crew were encased within nanomachines; they were able to survive the massive pressure and could only passively bear the crushing weight of Little Grey's white silk feet. They were forced to constantly breathe in the dense foot odor. Having lost the only weapons that they can re