-  gts_evt_humiliate.1050.desc: "Recently, §Y[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_planet.GetName]§! welcomed the harvest season. Large quantities of crops were packed and organized into boxes by high-tech harvesters. As our staff were inspecting the results, the sunlight suddenly disappeared, and strong winds swept across, overturning the collected food and the machines working in the fields.\n\n'This must be §Y[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_planet.GetName]§!, right? The ground here is a different color.'\n\nAppearing on §Y[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_planet.GetName]§! is §H[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_leader.GetName]§!. As the girl's giant face approaches, the blush on her cheeks shines through the clouds…  Her beautiful face reveals a hint of mischief, as if she has some ulterior motive for this farmland…\n\n'Hey… the little moss here looks glittery… Everyone must have put in a lot of effort… It's a remarkable achievement for little bugs… I've always been curious about what these locally produced foods taste like.'\n\nBy the time we realized something was wrong, it was already too late. §H[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_leader.GetName]§! slowly opens her slightly pink lips, her pink tongue swirling with steam, and slams it towards §Y[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_planet.GetName]§!. The poor residents and workers don't even have time to react before they are stuck in the taste bud folds of §H[event_target:gts_humiliate_targert_leader.GetName]§!'s tongue, becoming part of this 'feast.' As the giant wall of flesh slowly advances, bridges, farmlands, fortresses, machinery, everything people have built is crushed and deformed, becoming consumables for the girl's curiosity.\n\n'Mmm… These golden crumbs taste much better than those gray lichens. She was right…' \n\nAs the pink mountain of flesh deftly scoops up the facilities on the ground and brings them back up into the air for a closer taste, a gentle smile appears on the girl's face, and sh