nfirming that her feet were washed clean, she leaped heavily into space, but the land under her feet could not withstand such force, and the entire continent instantly cracked open, and magma spewed out.  But the shipgirl, who had already jumped out of the planet and into space, just looked back at the planet, which was now entirely brown, and smiled.  The previously beautiful blue-green planet was long gone, leaving only countless giant footprints."
 
