ied by a patch of white. Just a small area of skin under the giantess's toe pad has already domineeringly taken over the sky the little people had dreamed of for numerous nights and days. Subsequently, the giant toe, beyond the Karman line, is still slowly and steadily approaching the planet. Countless toe lines, as large as continents, swipe across the sky at an incredible speed, as if the sky has collapsed. By now, the nightmare of the little person civilization is not yet over. Information sent from a dust-like moon indicates that another toe next to this one is starting to open to the other side, and a cosmic surge of unknown components has rushed towards the planet from the gap between the two toes. But just as the government of the little people started to react, the flow of air emanating from the giantess's foot, carrying foot sweat and dirt, had already arrived on the planet. The unimaginable smell and foot sweat that fell like rain instantly shattered many cities on the planet. Countless little people suffocated due to being unable to adapt to the giantess's foot scent. Even the atmosphere of the planet started to be replaced by the giantess's scent.\n\nSoon, the saying of \"Goddess from the Stars\" began to spread like wildfire on the little people's planet. The remaining little people who could adapt to the giantess's giant toe swarmed to the streets, declaring that this was a blessing from the great goddess. Seemingly to confirm the saying, the remaining little people and tall buildings soared into the sky, gradually leaving the small planet under the giantess's greater pull, flying toward the paradise called \"toe\".\n\n\"Is that...enough? Feels pretty good...\"\n\nThe celestial-level giantess, who had been maintaining her posture, carefully wiggled her toe at this moment. Under this enormous disturbance, the tiny planet, including all of those who were still resisting, was shattered completely. All that was left was a batch of little people barely surviving in the toe lines on the giantess's toe tip. If those little people who had been drowned by the giantess's sweat and crushed by the dirt under the giantess's foot were excluded, the remaining little people might not be able to cross even one toe line of the giantess in their remaining lives, and could only become microbes raised on the giantess's toe tip forever.\n\n\"Yay-now I got little people on my toes～ I won't be laughed at by my sisters anymore～\"\n\nThe giantess's body disappeared in a burst of light. The celestial-level giantess happily left this star system, leaving behind a shattered planet in orbit, as if still narrating the adventure that had happened."
