-  gts_evt_random.040245.desc: "§H is really… a little tired…§! n\nHaving temporarily stepped away from the group, Ora, dressed in a swimsuit, returned to shore. She put on a sun hat and slipped into her custom-made rain boots—even on a sweltering summer day, when the other Giantesses were mostly bare, her outfit—which looked like something straight out of a photo shoot—still drew even more onlookers… Of course, there were plenty of people taking secret photos and whispering behind her back.\n\n§Y Hey, guys… why is this guy holding up a wooden sign to block the view up ahead…?\n\n“Deep Water—Keep Out”? Why would he put up a sign like that? Could it be that… §!\n\nAt the top of the TV tower, just as people were suddenly discussing this, everything suddenly went dark in front of them, and the crowd across the way began to look panicked:\n\nBecause the orange Giantess who had been on the beach just moments ago had now, using only her own body, completely surrounded this small TV tower. \n\n§H What are you guys talking about? Ora… I can’t hear you clearly. But—§!\n\n§H All I know is that I’m on leave today, so… if I’m not an administrator right now, doesn’t that mean I can do whatever I want without holding back?§! n\nAs the girl spoke, she opened her pink mouth. Everyone knew what lay within that bottomless pit—any person, building, ship, planet, or even an entire star system could gradually become part of her body, eroded by her stomach acid. Her pink tongue gently brushed against the outer surface of the TV tower; the glass it touched shattered instantly and was swallowed into her mouth with her breath. However, what was most terrifying were likely the tiny people who were about to become Ora’s special “snacks.” \n\nThen, as the girl breathed softly—yet with an unimaginable gravitational pull—her body was involuntarily drawn into that pink abyss. Until it was enveloped by the tongue’s surface, soft like moss, yet carrying a moist and warm breath. Yet his tightly enca