-  gts_evt_random.040248.desc: "Linfeng, having fully savored the thrill of destruction and teasing, without a word, roughly dragged Hitomi—her face flushed red and still too weak to protest—into the deep, azure sea beside the city. By now, the two had ventured deep into the open sea. Waves so massive they could swallow a person whole—which would be unfathomable to ordinary mortals—now barely reached the tops of their voluptuous thighs, smooth as white jade. Linfeng’s voluptuous arm—strong enough to easily crush a mountain range—unhesitatingly wrapped around Hitomi’s delicate, supple shoulders. With her overwhelming physical advantage, she pulled this usually haughty and arrogant “kitty” fiercely into her embrace, allowing their bodies to press together seamlessly. Hitomi, held fast in this embrace, now had her lovely face flushed with embarrassment—so red it seemed it might drip with moisture—and all traces of her previous aloof and scheming demeanor had vanished. The brown cat ears atop her head drooped helplessly, and her hands pressed against Linfeng’s full chest in a mix of shame and frustration, pushing him away only symbolically, while she let out soft whimpers and and sobbing softly, yet she was completely overwhelmed by Linfeng’s overwhelming physical strength and scorching body heat, leaving her no choice but to let this sultry Pink Fox embrace her as she pleased. \n\nAs they moved, colossal waves surged across the sea like a tidal wave; an entire joint fleet, fully prepared and attempting a final resistance, looked to them like nothing more than a pile of plastic debris floating in a bathtub. \n\n§rLook, Hitomi, these little toys are still firing at us~§!\n\nLinfeng laughed, completely oblivious to the tiny missiles and artillery fire striking her fair, supple thighs—not even leaving a single mark. Seizing the moment, she grabbed Hitomi’s fair, delicate wrist and forcefully pressed that warm palm down toward the sea’s surface. \n\nBOOM—!\n\nSwept up by Linfeng’s overwhelming power, Hitomi’s palm helplessly slammed into a carrier weighing tens of millions of metric tons. The sturdy steel deck instantly caved in and shattered beneath the Giantess’s tender palm. Accompanied by earth-shattering explosions and blinding flames, the entire aircraft carrier was smashed into the deep sea, reduced to a twisted heap of scrap metal. Hitomi felt a faint vibration and tingling sensation in the palm of her hand; her face flushed bright red. In a fit of pique, she lightly traced the air with her slender fingertips, slicing the two nearby destroyers in half as easily as cutting tofu, all the while muttering in embarrassment and annoyance:\n n§Y You mischievous Linfeng… It’s clearly you who wanted to play…§!\n\nLinfeng was tickled to bits by her tsundere yet inevitably compliant demeanor; the pair of towering, full breasts in front of her rose and fell violently, squeezing Hitomi in her arms until she was nearly suffocating. Linfeng freed one hand and teasingly pinched Hitomi’s brown cat ears, which were trembling with embarrassment, then wrapped her arms around her and slowly made her way toward the shoreline. With every step their colossal feet—large enough to block out the sky—took in the sea, they triggered a tsunami hundreds of meters high. The massive waves, carrying the wreckage of shattered warships, swept across the entire golden beach like a deluge. The beach’s fortifications and luxurious resort hotels were instantly shattered into debris by the combined force of the tsunami and the Giantess’s rampage. \n\n§rNext, let’s try something a little more intimate~§!\n\nLinfeng blew a gentle breath into Hitomi’s ear. Then, without giving Hitomi any chance to react, she suddenly tightened her arms and violently threw Hitomi’s entire body toward the beach! Amid a thunderous roar, the two colossal figures—each thousands of meters tall—crashed down in an intimate embrace. Linfeng loomed over Hitomi, pinning her firmly beneath her. Countless tiny persons on the beach—still fleeing in despair and shrieking in agony—couldn’t even tell which way to run before they were mercilessly crushed and flattened in an instant by the snow-white skin and voluptuous hips and buttocks crashing down from the sky. The golden sand was instantly stained a blinding dark red by an endless stream of blood. Hitomi was half-forced beneath Linfeng; the fabric of their swimsuits shifted slightly under the intense friction, and vast swaths of snow-white, smooth skin pressed tightly together, radiating scorching heat. An overwhelming sense of shame caused this proud cat girl to completely lose her senses. Her brown cat tail finally couldn’t resist and meekly wrapped itself around Linfeng’s pink fox tail. Amid the deathly silent ruins, surrounded by billowing black smoke and a rain of blood, as they intimately pressed against each other, panting softly, and thrust the nearby buildings into each other’s pussies, all while using their perfect bodies to ruthlessly erase every trace of what had once existed on this coastline."
