-  # Original: 很显然，喷洒乳汁并不是最终目的。果然，少女又说出了新的指令。\n\"清洁液喷洒完成，开始涂抹消毒液并进行吸尘清洁。\"\n紧接着少女脱下了裤子，露出了粉嫩的蜜穴。紧接着，少女的蜜穴紧紧的贴在了城市的废墟上面，开始了前后挪动。随着一声声清脆的呻吟，城市废墟要么被少女的阴毛抹去，要么被吸入少女的蜜穴，消失在无边的肉色之中。少女的动作越来越快，呼吸越来越沉重，呻吟越来越大声，最终，随着一阵响亮的尖叫，粘稠的爱液海填满了之前废墟遗留的空地，与乳汁混合在了一起。
+  # Original: 很显然，喷洒乳汁并不是最终目的。果然， maiden又说出了新的指令。\n\"清洁液喷洒完成，开始涂抹消毒液并进行吸尘清洁。\"\n紧接着 maiden脱下了裤子，露出了粉嫩的蜜穴。紧接着， maiden的蜜穴紧紧的贴在了城市的废墟上面，开始了前后挪动。随着一声声清脆的呻吟，城市废墟要么被 maiden的阴毛抹去，要么被吸入 maiden的蜜穴，消失在无边的肉色之中。 maiden的动作越来越快，呼吸越来越沉重，呻吟越来越大声，最终，随着一阵响亮的尖叫，粘稠的爱液海填满了之前废墟遗留的空地，与乳汁混合在了一起。
   tiny_enclave_event.307.desc:0 "Obviously, spraying milk was not the ultimate goal. Sure enough, the girl spoke a new command.\n\"Cleaning fluid spraying complete, start applying disinfectant and vacuum cleaning.\"\nImmediately after, the girl took off her pants, revealing her pink and tender honey pot. Then, the girl's honey pot pressed tightly against the city ruins and began moving back and forth. With crisp moans, the city ruins were either wiped away by the girl's pubic hair or sucked into the girl's honey pot, disappearing into the boundless flesh color. The girl's movements became faster and faster, her breathing heavier, her moans louder. Finally, with a loud scream, sticky love fluid filled the empty space left by the ruins, mixing with the milk."
-  # Original: 今天对于§H[Root.GetName]§!来说本来是平静的一天。不过，作为协助§H微型交易组织§!以放置机器人的地点注定不会平静。蓝色的天空瞬间被阴影填满，紧接着一双巨足踩下，瞬间将城市踩碎。这是一位少女型机器人。\n\"A-3桌面清理型清洁机器人到达位置，请主人下令。\"\n我们急忙尝试联系少女，但是不知道是因为机器人过于老旧还是因为我们过于渺小，一切通信均无法得到回应。\n\"未获得回应，自动清洁模式启动，开始评估清洁范围。\"\n突然，踩碎我们城市的巨大双脚开始了走动，连带的踩碎了我们的数个城市。数百万人被踩成红点，与城市废墟混合，粘在这双巨足之下。本来在§H[Root.GetName]§!上建立了繁荣都市的人们，如今和他们的城市一同如垃圾一样被少女踩踏着。这颗星球的人们因为过于渺小的体型而无法被判断为知性生命体，而是被判断为了需要清理的灰尘，只是因为他们太小了，小到可以轻松的被巨大的双脚所覆盖，轻易的被这双脚所蹂躏。很快，§H[Root.GetName]§!的城市已被少女完全蹂躏，所有的建筑全部化为废墟，只有少数人幸存在废墟中。
-  tiny_enclave_event.305.desc:0 "Today was supposed to be a calm day for §H[Root.GetName]§!. However, serving as a location for assisting the §HMicro Transaction Organization§! to place robots was destined not to be peaceful. The blue sky was instantly filled with shadows, followed by a pair of giant feet stepping down, instantly crushing the city. It was a girl-type robot.\n\"A-3 Desktop Cleaning Robot arrived at position, asking master for orders.\"\nWe scrambled to try to contact the girl, but whether it was because the robot was too old or because we were too tiny, no communication received any response.\n\"No response received, automatic cleaning mode started, evaluating cleaning range.\"\nSuddenly, the giant feet that crushed our city began to walk, crushing several more of our cities along with it. Millions of people were trampled into red spots, mixed with city ruins, sticking under these giant feet. People who had built prosperous cities on §H[Root.GetName]§! were now trampled by the girl like garbage along with their cities. The people of this planet were judged not as intelligent life forms due to their overly tiny size, but as dust needing cleaning, simply because they were too small—small enough to be easily covered by giant feet, easily ravaged by these feet. Soon, the cities of §H[Root.GetName]§! were completely ravaged by the girl, all buildings turned to ruins, with only a few survivors in the rubble."
