   tiny_enclave_event.308.desc:0 "The girl who finished masturbating stopped in place, seeming to rest, while we stared at her closely, not knowing what she would do next.\n\"Cleaning program complete, finally executing drying program.\"\nIt seemed it was finally over, our hearts finally settled down. However, the girl didn't put on clothes, but aimed her anus at the ground.\n\"Air freshener filling started\"\nWith the girl's words, the chrysanthemum began to wiggle, as if a sky-devouring giant beast wanted to open its mouth to swallow everything, or a lair of a giant beast about to release a terrifying monster.\n\"Air freshener filling complete, start release.\"\nAccompanied by a huge roar loud enough to shake the earth, the girl farted. In the huge roar, a hollow was blown out of the love fluid sea, and surging love fluid and milk drowned other places.\n\"Drying failed, speculated insufficient gas, start releasing more gas.\"\nWith the girl's words, roars sounded again. The girl farted one after another. Even if the city was intact, it couldn't survive under this fart attack. The toxic gas released from the girl's body quickly filled the atmosphere and covered the entire planet. People still struggling in love fluid and milk were now eroded by poisonous gas, reduced to bugs that could only be in heat towards giantesses.\n\"Drying failed, abandon drying, wait for cleaning fluid to dry automatically. No harmful substances and pests detected, cleaning complete, waiting for next instruction.\"\nThe girl finished speaking and stopped moving. Until a message was received by her, she flew into the universe. Investigation showed that signal came from the §HMicro Transaction Organization§!."
