   tiny_enclave_event.306.desc:0 "As expected, the robot ignored our refusal. The communication channel only came with a cold chaotic sound, as if mocking our powerlessness.\n\"Target lock confirmed, start cleaning.\"\nThe girl's voice sounded again, without any emotion. Then, she raised her giant foot and stomped heavily towards a city on §H[Root.GetName]§!. In the earth-shaking tremor, the city was instantly flattened, countless lives vanished in an instant. The girl didn't stop, she walked on the planet's surface, every step accompanied by the destruction of a city. Her movement was so elegant, like dancing, but under her feet were endless death and destruction."
   # Original: 报酬已发送，请签收。对了，那个机器人你想怎么处理
   tiny_enclave_event.310.desc:0 "The girl who finished cleaning seemed not satisfied yet. She found a huge lake on §H[Root.GetName]§!, then squatted down, aiming her mesmerizing anus at the lake.\n\"Start releasing cleaning fluid\"\nAccompanied by the girl's order, a huge water column sprayed out from her anus, rushing straight into the lake. The lake water was instantly dyed white, and the water level rose rapidly, quickly submerging the surrounding cities. The girl's expression was very enjoyable, it seems this excretion brought her great pleasure. The people on §H[Root.GetName]§! looked at the white flood falling from the sky in despair, that was the girl's excrement, but for them, it was an irresistible natural disaster."
