d out Miss D by her real name in front of everyone. §BOh, I'm listening, listening......§!\nSeemingly slapped with sudden shock, Miss D's body trembled slightly upon hearing her name, promptly agreeing while twisting her hips and pressing down on her foot.\n§MNow, it's your turn, discuss the progress on the project you were responsible for last month. §!\nThe middle-aged woman glanced at Miss D, then relinquished the 'center stage' for Miss D to step up.\n§BOkay... sure.....§!\nMiss D took the documents on the table, prepared for a month, yet a subtle sound was nevertheless recorded.\n§BOh..... can you stop moving, it's so itchy.....§!\nMiss D pursed her lips in an attempt to endure the discomfort from the soles-appearing both itchy and painful-struggling to stand from her seat while striving not to draw attention to the peculiarities inside her shoes. The fine black heels tapped lightly on the marble floor, producing gentle 'da-da' sounds.\n§BOh dear..... that spot between my toes is acting up again......§!\nMiss D walked to the lectern, prepared to begin her presentation. Then the itch between her big toe and second toe heightened, finally forcing her, or subconsciously, to rub her toes strongly."
 
