r, in Yan's eyes, he was instantly imprisoned in a world of pink without any means of resisting. It did not
+    take long for him to realize that what had been obscuring the sun was the naked lower body of the maiden before him.\nTo a species that had ventured into the cosmos and knew of the concept of shame, Yaorong's action was nothing short of an insult-arrogantly displaying one's genitals, even threatening to urinate on them. Yet, she cared absolutely nothing. After all, to Yaorong, this small rocky planet with billions of inhabitants was too tiny, not even enough to be considered parasites on her body.\nBut even knowing resistance was impossible and that the empire's main fleet had already been devoured by Yaorong as a snack, when Yaorong flushed and aimed her urethra at the planet, which had already ceased all rotation and revolution, they still made futile attempts at resistance.\nWhile Yaorong was still flexing her lower body, trying to prevent the planet from being destroyed too early by her biological processes, they finally launched their counterattack.\nThe (opposing empire name) no longer had any starbases or shipyards, nor did they have spaceships equipped with FTL engines. In fact, they could not even muster a single corvette, and could only mount tactical nuclear warheads on \"primitive\" fighters in a futile gesture of resistance.\nThe first wave of attacks saw hundreds of fighters take off, yet the closer they got to Yaorong's lower body, the more they felt their insignificance. The folds of Yaorong's lower body were far wider than the deepest trench on this planet, and the valley between her thighs was tens of thousands of meters wide, so much so that even a battleship could probably fit there, let alone those fighters barely escaping the atmosphere.\nAfter witnessing such \"beauty\" as if it were a divine miracle, the final act of futile resistance had arrived -- the fighters, moving slower than snails, were clear as day to Yaorong. They had survived until now simply because the girl had become playful and wanted to see what sort of feeling she would get from the desperate struggle of such a weak civilization.\nFinally, the ultimate weapons of the atomic age fulfilled its purpose, despite that the planet-shattering weapons' final target being the urethra of a young girl. There was no glory in that, nor did they know if their do-or-die attack had even worked in the smoke-filled scene.\nYaorong, who was thinking about where to begin her release, finally felt the futile resistance of this civilization. While atomic weapons could not even scratch Yaorong's scales, it was a different matter if they were to explode on a sensitive spot like her urethra.\n\"§PHmm... is that all?§!\"\nThe greatest yield of atomic weapons that the fighters could carry merely resulted in a tickling sensation to Yaorong. And this was despite her clenching her lower body, baring her clitoris and urethra as if inviting the attacks of the microscopic beings.\n\"§PThis sensation isn't enough...!§!\"\nThe girl's murmur was still soft, but her actions were a perfect display of brutality. Her verdant fingers once again pressed down on the surface of the planet, but this time it was different from the previous action of stopping the planet-- what she was doing was digging up the city complexes built on the planet.\nYan watched this scene unfold in utter desperation. He had witnessed the do-or-die resistance and realized that not only had the nuclear weapons failed to hurt the monstrous being who had trapped him, but it had even incited her to play more. She had even lifted a whole continental shelf with her hand, placing it next to her lower body!\nHe wanted to roar, but how could the monster who obscured the sky possibly care about screams from someone who was less than a louse; he wanted to resist, but his arms and legs were already restrained on this pink continent; he wanted to end his life, unable to stand by and watch his people being subjected to such a humiliating massacre... But even death was at the mercy of the monster.\nAn entire continental shelf only occupied about a quarter of Yaorong's palm. And the numerous high rises on top of it and the
+    people living at the surface became even more insignificant. But even though these civilizations were as insignificant as microbes, they still chose to resist Yaorong's humiliating massacre.\nLand-based nuclear missiles launched one after another. This was a do-or-die counterattack, the most dazzling display of a dying civilization. Whether it was out of a twisted sense of humor or because she actually wanted to experience what it would be like, Yaorong leaned forward again, using her urethra to steadily receive this desperate act of resistance.\n\"§POoh...§!\"\nDifferent from the tactical nuclear bombs carried by the fighters, these land-based strategic nuclear missiles were originally designed for deterrence. Under normal conditions, they could destroy even a battleship with a direct hit, but even such a powerful weapon, exploding at the girl's urethra only brought...\nYaorong finally relaxed, no longer forcefully holding back her body, letting golden urine pour out like the cataclysmic flood described in the Bible. Of course, before taking such relieving action, the little dragon had already retracted her hand, as she had other plans for the \"continent\" in her hands.\nOther than the first strategic nuclear missile, which successfully gave Yaorong a strange sensation, the second and the following strategic nuclear missiles that were about to hit Yaorong were completely destroyed by her urine. The terrifying weapons that could destroy a city or even a battleship was even weaker than the urine that the maiden released. The nuclear weapons that could have killed hundreds of thousands or millions of people could only spark a few lights in front of Yaorong's urine.\nHot, golden liquid fell from the sky. That was the result of a young girl's physiological need. That was but an act of victory.\nYan witnessed the highest peak of the planet, a mountain called sacred, melt away in the torrent of golden urine. The sacred snow cap and majestic mountain melted like butter in the maiden's waste liquid. Next was the great river, which flowed between the many cities and had always been referred to by this civilization as their mother river. However, the mother river that they had tried to protect with all their strength, along with the city complexes built around it, was also drowned in the golden flood of destruction; Whether it was the ecological garden that had nurtured ancient flora and fauna or the ecological forest that had long since become a nature reserve, their continued existence was perhaps only to make Yaorong feel more fulfilled and superior towards these weaklings as she urinated.\nYan closed his eyes in despair. He knew that his friends, his embraces, his planet, his civilization... had all disappeared completely. The monster who had trapped him inside her lower body; one of her physiological behaviors alone was enough to destroy the evolutionary path of a civilization... and not a single trace of shame could be discerned from her, as if the 6 billion people who had died under her urine were no more significant to her than a casual meal!\n\"§PAh... it's over...!§!\"\nYaorong did not let out any lewd sound of pleasure. Despite knowing that she was now the only one left in this star system and the insignificant being parasitic on her lower body, the sense of \"modesty\" let her maintain her usual behavior. \n\"§PIs this the last spark left of their civilization?§!\"\nYaorong's voice was still flat; and under the gaze of her golden eyes, the remaining civilization in the city was already kneeling on the ground in despair. But Yaorong couldn't hear it, or wouldn't pay attention even if she could. Her only thought now was to use that continental shelf, which was barely enough to be considered tissue paper, to wipe off the residual urine from her urethra.\n\"§PIt's...quite useful.§!\"\nThe continental shelf with over 500 million people, hundreds of giant city settlements, and a complete terrain was now being used as a tissue paper to wipe the lower body of the maiden. The intelligent life on the continental shelf was completely annihilated
+    at the moment of direct contact with Yaorong's tender flesh, leaving behind only their corpses and their once magnificent cities being rubbed repeatedly against the maiden's urethra... \n\"§PHopefully father won't blame me...!§!\"\nLooking at the golden, ammonia-smelling planet, Yaorong's face was still flushed -- she didn't care about any destruction that might result from her physiological needs. However, she cared about your opinion, a lot! And in fact, if you told her firsthand to not act in that way, she would certainly follow right away... even if she had some minor grievances in her mind.\nFinally, after re-dressing, Yaorong finally remembered the order you had given her -- to make sure that the leaders of the opposing empire knew what their faults were. However, the little one frowned and averted her gaze after looking at the planet completely taken over by her own urine. She knew she was going to get a scolding if she were to show this current result to you.\nFortunately, Yaorong finally remembered that she had somewhat finished what you had given her before the execution.\n\"§POh, I almost forgot about you, you poor thing. You must hate me very much, given how the world in which you have lived for generations has simply disappeared. But don't worry, you can soon join them.§!\"\nYaorong's scoff finally broke Yan's last line of defense... but now he could only live on barely under Yaorong's genitals, surviving off of the scraps of the ruined cities and the urine of Yaorong. \nWill he succeed in his vengeance?\nOr will he become an unremarkable louse on Yaorong's body?\nYaorong didn't care. She had simply finished the task given to her and solved her physiological needs -- and as for the 6.5 billion lives who had died under her urine... Yaorong had never cared from the beginning."
