ly closed it after the little guys' colony ship entered her body. After confirming that her sister, father, and the little shapeshifter that she was raising were not around watching her embarrassing actions, the little dragon could finally relax.\n\nSince her embarrassing moment has not been discovered, then everything was fine  -  could those little guys cause chaos in her body?"
