   gts_god_keeper.132.title: "The Kith"
-  gts_god_keeper.132.desc: "§P “You’re saying that… umm, I understand.” §!\n\nThe girl’s face was showing signs of distress, but in addition to that, her eyes were constantly looking at you, seemingly wanting to gauge what was in your expression. But, it was obvious that even you had never encountered such a situation before - this brand-new race could obtain everything they needed to survive, just by offering loyalty to your daughter.\n\nThe little girl picked you and her kith's leader up, holding you in front of her face, and her golden eyes were sparkling. What was simply your little dragon acting cute and silly to you, was seen as her supreme god showing their most devoted followers a gentle smile.\n\n§P “So, Father, that… is not my fault, right?” §!\n\n§Y  “I have never blamed you.” §!\n\n§H  “...My Lord?” §!\n\nIn contrast to the gentleness she showed when talking to you, her father, even when it was her kith, who was spawned from her body, that interrupted their conversation, the little dragon got angry. \n\n§P  “Don’t interrupt!” §!\n\nYaorong’s fingers clenched, pressing the dragon girl who was over ninety meters tall into her palm - if she hadn’t such a good grasp of her power, she might have been able to make your body fly away with it. \n\n§P “Father, I have already taught her a lesson… don't be angry at me, okay…” §!\n\nYaorong’s ingratiating smile and her kith’s leader’s painful yet satisfied expression made you feel at a loss for words. Your little dragon was really an adorable little one, but she could not even be slightly rational whenever it involved a problem with you.  \n\n§P “Father, can you look at me instead? Or do you think that little one is more beautiful than me?” §!\n\nNot to mention being slightly rational, as long as you weren’t alone with her, her jealousy would inexplicably skyrocket. The targets of her jealousy include same-sex, other-sex, old people, children, other forms of life, animals, and even her own sister. \n\n§Y “No, you are the most beautiful” §!\n\nEven if the little one would always love you, her power was still too terrifying, and you dared not let your guard down in front of this little monster – and she does indeed look beautiful, doesn’t she?\n\nThe little dragon's gaze became clear again, and her beautiful face was filled a smile of ingratiation as if she was honored to simply have been praised by her father using a statement of fact.\n\n§P  “Yaorong, do you have any plans for your kith…?” §!\n\nThe kith’s leader whom was pressed by Yaorong's finger actually stood quite tall; a body that was ninety or nearly a hundred meters tall was tall enough for most mortal races to look up to. In addition to that, inheriting the characteristics of their god was not just for show; their combat capabilities were also not to be underestimated.\n\nBut she was only meeting her god - not to mention a being birthed from Yaorong, even those behemoths who call themselves Leviathans or those dreadnoughts that have turned into calamites were nothing more than delicious or not-so-delicious snacks.\n\n§P  “I don’t know,  I could keep them on me forever. But you seem not to like that, Father, right~” §!\n\nThe little one lifted her finger, allowing her kith to stand up - she was wearing a nun's robe with black as the main color, according to their culture, the highest leader was also the one closest to and who needed to directly serve the god. You glanced at the high priestess or pope who was as silly as your daughter, and started to get worried. \n\nIt seems my own terrifyingly strong, silly daughter had a debuff aura that lowers intelligence, what should I do? help, I'm in a hurry!\n\n§H  “Father…The goddess said that from this day onwards, we will follow your orders.” §!\n\nThe tall girl who was almost one-hundred meter tall kneeled before you, exposing a standard imperial vow of allegiance - but what the hell is with that priestess title!\n\nYou looked at your own little dragon with slight anger, but she had already raised her large dragon tail to cover her face, leaving behind nothing but a wanton
+  gts_god_keeper.132.desc: "§P \"You're saying that... umm, I understand.\" §!\n\nThe girl's face was showing signs of distress, but in addition to that, her eyes were constantly looking at you, seemingly wanting to gauge what was in your expression. But, it was obvious that even you had never encountered such a situation before - this brand-new race could obtain everything they needed to survive, just by offering loyalty to your daughter.\n\nThe little girl picked you and her kith's leader up, holding you in front of her face, and her golden eyes were sparkling. What was simply your little dragon acting cute and silly to you, was seen as her supreme god showing their most devoted followers a gentle smile.\n\n§P \"So, Father, that... is not my fault, right?\" §!\n\n§Y  \"I have never blamed you.\" §!\n\n§H  \"...My Lord?\" §!\n\nIn contrast to the gentleness she showed when talking to you, her father, even when it was her kith, who was spawned from her body, that interrupted their conversation, the little dragon got angry. \n\n§P  \"Don't interrupt!\" §!\n\nYaorong's fingers clenched, pressing the dragon girl who was over ninety meters tall into her palm - if she hadn't such a good grasp of her power, she might have been able to make your body fly away with it. \n\n§P \"Father, I have already taught her a lesson... don't be angry at me, okay...\" §!\n\nYaorong's ingratiating smile and her kith's leader's painful yet satisfied expression made you feel at a loss for words. Your little dragon was really an adorable little one, but she could not even be slightly rational whenever it involved a problem with you.  \n\n§P \"Father, can you look at me instead? Or do you think that little one is more beautiful than me?\" §!\n\nNot to mention being slightly rational, as long as you weren't alone with her, her jealousy would inexplicably skyrocket. The targets of her jealousy include same-sex, other-sex, old people, children, other forms of life, animals, and even her own sister. \n\n§Y \"No, you are the most beautiful\" §!\n\nEven if the little one would always love you, her power was still too terrifying, and you dared not let your guard down in front of this little monster  -  and she does indeed look beautiful, doesn't she?\n\nThe little dragon's gaze became clear again, and her beautiful face was filled a smile of ingratiation as if she was honored to simply have been praised by her father using a statement of fact.\n\n§P  \"Yaorong, do you have any plans for your kith...?\" §!\n\nThe kith's leader whom was pressed by Yaorong's finger actually stood quite tall; a body that was ninety or nearly a hundred meters tall was tall enough for most mortal races to look up to. In addition to that, inheriting the characteristics of their god was not just for show; their combat capabilities were also not to be underestimated.\n\nBut she was only meeting her god - not to mention a being birthed from Yaorong, even those behemoths who call themselves Leviathans or those dreadnoughts that have turned into calamites were nothing more than delicious or not-so-delicious snacks.\n\n§P  \"I don't know,  I could keep them on me forever. But you seem not to like that, Father, right~\" §!\n\nThe little one lifted her finger, allowing her kith to stand up - she was wearing a nun's robe with black as the main color, according to their culture, the highest leader was also the one closest to and who needed to directly serve the god. You glanced at the high priestess or pope who was as silly as your daughter, and started to get worried. \n\nIt seems my own terrifyingly strong, silly daughter had a debuff aura that lowers intelligence, what should I do? help, I'm in a hurry!\n\n§H  \"Father...The goddess said that from this day onwards, we will follow your orders.\" §!\n\nThe tall girl who was almost one-hundred meter tall kneeled before you, exposing a standard imperial vow of allegiance - but what the hell is with that priestess title!\n\nYou looked at your o