   gts_ultra_company.1017.desc: "§r\"Um, I hope everyone tries our Tongue Lick Insurance. We will protect you responsibly. If it's too expensive, I'll lower the price for you.\"§!\n\nThough she spoke gently, when the ten-thousand-times-larger maiden landed in the ocean, the impact split the crust like an eggshell. Tsunamis destroyed coastal cities instantly. Skyscrapers hoping to block the waves were twisted like pretzels. The few survivors escaped only to be crushed by water pressure.\n\n§r\"I messed up! What to do!\"§!\n\nThe maiden cried seeing the massacre, pacing nervously. Every step created new waves, destroying more. She didn't realize.\n\n§r\"I know! Sorry everyone, watch this! Tongue Lick Insurance is for this! Run out of the city!\"§!\n\nShe didn't give them time. She stepped towards the waves, crushing refugees under her shadow. Every step was a massacre. If she really fought, could humans survive an hour?\n\n§r\"Sorry, I'm making a firebreak here! I'll resurrect you later! Excuse me!\"§!\n\nTrying to save them, she lay down in the waves, but her 160,000-meter height crushed several cities, turning survivors and safe people alike into brown soil."
   # [fromfrom.GetName]已投保！
