   gts_ultra_company.4005.desc: "The one coming to §Y[event_target:gts_bruh_get_insurance_planet.GetName]§! this time is a fashionably dressed, even slightly punk-styled Giantess salesperson. Her waist is hung with various strangely-sized capsules, and she looks full of interest. She skillfully operates the silver spoon, with surgical precision, uprooting several of the wealthiest satellite cities around the planetary capital. Amidst the ear-piercing sound of the crust breaking, these cities are sent as whole pieces into anti-gravity containers, sealed like exhibits. Immediately after, she excitedly rubs her hands together and takes out a pink, high-speed-vibrating giant egg toy from one of the capsules at her waist, its volume even exceeding the planet's moon. She doesn't turn off the power, but directly drops this devastating toy vibrating at a high frequency onto the planet's surface. The intense vibration waves it emits instantly conduct to the planetary core. The entire planet begins to tremble violently like sifting chaff, and tectonic resonance causes a global-scale earthquake of magnitude twelve or higher to occur simultaneously. The surface ebbs and flows like waves, solid fortifications turn to powder in the vibration, and all glass products shatter at the same instant. The salesperson doesn't stop; she then takes out a giant dildo covered with bumps and enthusiastically uses it to \"cultivate\" the planet's surface, like a rolling pin flattening dough, pushing flat all protrusions on a piece of continent, whether they be mountain peaks or cities. The lubricant remaining on the surface of the tool leaves long, shimmering trails on the ground, these fluids being slippery and difficult to clean. \"See that? This is my little toy,\" she brandishes the giant implement in her hand, laughing so hard she shakes. \"Without insurance, next time I'll shove it into this planet's core and let it vibrate, that would surely be more interesting!\" Under the terrified gaze of the tiny people, she retracts her toy and leaves satisfied. According to statistics, the population successfully placed into containers as premiums in this operation was §Y[event_target:gts_bruh_get_insurance_planet.gts_bruh_get_planet_transfer_count_pop_amount]§!, while the total number of accidental deaths during the uprooting and demonstration process reached §Y[event_target:gts_bruh_get_insurance_planet.gts_bruh_get_planet_killed_pop_count_pop_amount]§!."
