ions. We hope this experience doesn’t awaken any unsavory hobbies in her. \nAt least she’s cooperating with the effort. The Administrative Department will dispatch a large number of mechanical units into her urethra to construct flood barriers and drying devices, in order to prevent more urine from flowing into the Milky Way. She will also limit her outings during this period, quietly waiting for the storm she created to subside. The Public Relations Department will also impose news restrictions to prevent the spread of statements such as “[event_target:gts_random_storm_leader_target.GetName] extinguished a star while urinating”—statements that, while factually accurate, would damage her personal image. \nOur scientists predict that this rift is unstable and will close completely within a few months to a few years. However, the sweat storm that has already been poured into the Milky Way through the portal can only be left to time to resolve."
